window.IELTS_TOPIC={"topic":4,"en":"Oceans & Marine Ecosystems","zh":"海洋與海洋生態","items":[{"w":"seabed","pos":"n.","def":"the ground at the bottom of the sea","cn":"海床","s":"The divers found an old anchor lying on the sandy ________, and they carefully brought it up to the boat.","zh":"潛水員在沙質的海床上發現一個老舊的錨,他們小心地把它帶上船。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A1","t":"海床"},{"w":"trench","pos":"n.","def":"a very deep, narrow valley in the ocean floor","cn":"海溝","s":"The Mariana ________ is deeper than Mount Everest is tall, so very few people have ever reached its bottom.","zh":"馬里亞納海溝比聖母峰還要深,所以極少有人曾到達它的底部。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A2","t":"海溝"},{"w":"abyss","pos":"n.","def":"a very deep place that seems to have no bottom","cn":"深淵","s":"The documentary showed strange fish living in the dark ________, where sunlight never reaches and the water is freezing cold.","zh":"這部紀錄片介紹了住在黑暗深淵裡的奇特魚類,那裡陽光永遠照不到,而且海水冰冷刺骨。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A3","t":"深淵"},{"w":"abyssal","pos":"adj.","def":"found in the deepest parts of the ocean","cn":"深海底層的","s":"Scientists know very little about ________ animals because they live thousands of metres down, and their habitat is hard to reach.","zh":"科學家對深海底層的動物所知甚少,因為牠們住在數千公尺深的地方,而且牠們的棲地很難抵達。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A4","t":"深海底層的"},{"w":"continental shelf","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the shallow sea floor near the edge of a continent","cn":"大陸棚","s":"Most fish are caught on the ______ ______ because the water there is shallow, and sunlight helps plants and plankton grow.","zh":"大部分的魚是在大陸棚捕獲的,因為那裡的海水較淺,而且陽光能幫助植物和浮游生物生長。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A5","t":"大陸棚"},{"w":"ridge","pos":"n.","def":"a long, narrow line of high land or mountains","cn":"海脊;山脊","s":"A huge underwater ________ runs through the middle of the Atlantic, and new sea floor slowly forms along it.","zh":"一條巨大的海底海脊貫穿大西洋中部,新的海床沿著它慢慢形成。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A6","t":"海脊"},{"w":"basin","pos":"n.","def":"a large, low area of land or sea floor shaped like a bowl","cn":"盆地;海盆","s":"The Pacific Ocean ________ is the largest on Earth, and it covers almost one third of the planet's surface.","zh":"太平洋海盆是地球上最大的,它幾乎覆蓋了地球表面的三分之一。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A7","t":"海盆"},{"w":"seamount","pos":"n.","def":"an underwater mountain that does not reach the surface","cn":"海底山","s":"Sharks often gather around a ________ because food is plentiful there, so fishermen like to visit these underwater mountains.","zh":"鯊魚常常聚集在海底山附近,因為那裡食物豐富,所以漁民喜歡造訪這些海底山。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A8","t":"海底山"},{"w":"strait","pos":"n.","def":"a narrow area of sea that joins two larger seas","cn":"海峽","s":"Ferries cross the Taiwan ________ every day, but the trip can be rough when strong winds blow in winter.","zh":"渡輪每天橫越台灣海峽,但冬天颳強風時航程可能會很顛簸。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A9","t":"海峽"},{"w":"gulf","pos":"n.","def":"a large area of sea mostly surrounded by land","cn":"海灣(大型)","s":"Many oil platforms stand in the ________ of Mexico, and they have caused serious pollution after accidents in the past.","zh":"墨西哥灣有許多石油平台,而且它們過去在意外發生後造成了嚴重的污染。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A10","t":"灣"},{"w":"bay","pos":"n.","def":"a part of the sea that curves into the land","cn":"海灣","s":"We rented kayaks and paddled around the quiet ________, while our parents relaxed on the beach and read their books.","zh":"我們租了獨木舟在寧靜的海灣划船,而我們的父母則在海灘上放鬆看書。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A11","t":"海灣"},{"w":"lagoon","pos":"n.","def":"an area of calm sea water separated from the ocean by sand or reef","cn":"潟湖","s":"The water in the ________ is calm and warm, so it is a safe place for children to swim and snorkel.","zh":"潟湖裡的海水平靜又溫暖,所以對孩子來說是游泳和浮潛的安全地方。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A12","t":"潟湖"},{"w":"inlet","pos":"n.","def":"a narrow area of water that goes into the land from the sea","cn":"小海灣;水灣","s":"Small fishing boats hide in the ________ during typhoons, because the hills around it block the strongest winds.","zh":"颱風期間小漁船會躲在小海灣裡,因為周圍的山丘能擋住最強的風。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A13","t":"小海灣"},{"w":"peninsula","pos":"n.","def":"land almost surrounded by water but joined to a larger area","cn":"半島","s":"Hengchun is on a ________ in southern Taiwan, so visitors can see the sea on three sides of the town.","zh":"恆春位在台灣南部的一個半島上,所以遊客可以在小鎮的三面看見大海。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A14","t":"半島"},{"w":"archipelago","pos":"n.","def":"a group of many islands","cn":"群島","s":"The Philippines is a large ________ of over 7,000 islands, and many people travel between them by boat.","zh":"菲律賓是一個由超過七千座島嶼組成的大群島,許多人搭船往返於島嶼之間。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A15","t":"群島"},{"w":"atoll","pos":"n.","def":"a ring-shaped coral island around a lagoon","cn":"環礁","s":"The tiny ________ is only two metres above the sea, so rising water is a serious danger for the people living there.","zh":"這個小環礁只高出海面兩公尺,所以上升的海水對住在那裡的人是嚴重的危險。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A16","t":"環礁"},{"w":"shoreline","pos":"n.","def":"the edge of the sea where it meets the land","cn":"海岸線","s":"Volunteers walked along the ________ for three hours, and they collected more than fifty bags of rubbish.","zh":"志工們沿著海岸線走了三個小時,他們收集了超過五十袋垃圾。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A17","t":"海岸線"},{"w":"shallows","pos":"n.","def":"an area of shallow water","cn":"淺灘;淺水區","s":"Young fish stay in the ________ near the beach because big predators cannot easily follow them there.","zh":"幼魚待在海灘附近的淺水區,因為大型掠食者不容易跟著牠們到那裡。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A18","t":"淺水區"},{"w":"depth","pos":"n.","def":"how deep something is","cn":"深度","s":"The submarine reached a ________ of 3,000 metres, but the crew had to return because the battery was getting low.","zh":"潛水艇到達了三千公尺的深度,但組員必須返航,因為電池電量越來越低。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A19","t":"深度"},{"w":"surface","pos":"n.","def":"the top layer of water or land","cn":"表面;水面","s":"The whale came up to the ________ to breathe, and everyone on the boat cheered when they saw its huge tail.","zh":"那頭鯨魚浮上水面呼吸,船上的每個人看到牠巨大的尾巴時都歡呼了起來。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A20","t":"水面"},{"w":"sunlit","pos":"adj.","def":"receiving light from the sun","cn":"陽光照射的","s":"Most ocean life lives in the ________ top layer of the sea, because plants there can use light to make food.","zh":"大部分的海洋生物生活在海洋陽光照射的最上層,因為那裡的植物能利用光來製造食物。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A21","t":"陽光照射的"},{"w":"twilight zone","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the dim ocean layer between about 200 and 1,000 metres deep","cn":"中層帶;暮光帶","s":"Very little light reaches the ______ ______, so many fish there have huge eyes to help them see.","zh":"極少光線能到達暮光帶,所以那裡的許多魚有巨大的眼睛幫助牠們看見東西。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A22","t":"暮光帶"},{"w":"hydrothermal vent","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a crack in the sea floor that lets out very hot water","cn":"熱泉噴口","s":"Scientists were surprised to find crabs and worms living near a ______ ______, although the water there was extremely hot.","zh":"科學家驚訝地發現螃蟹和蠕蟲生活在熱泉噴口附近,儘管那裡的水極度炙熱。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A23","t":"熱泉噴口"},{"w":"upwelling","pos":"n.","def":"the rising of cold, deep water to the surface","cn":"湧升流","s":"________ brings cold, nutrient-rich water to the surface, so the area becomes an excellent place for fishing.","zh":"湧升流把寒冷、富含養分的海水帶到表面,所以這個區域成為絕佳的漁場。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A24","t":"湧升流"},{"w":"gyre","pos":"n.","def":"a large system of circular ocean currents","cn":"環流","s":"Floating rubbish gets trapped in the North Pacific ________, and it slowly forms a huge area of plastic waste.","zh":"漂浮的垃圾被困在北太平洋環流中,而且慢慢形成一大片塑膠垃圾區。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A25","t":"環流"},{"w":"swell","pos":"n.","def":"long, smooth waves caused by distant winds","cn":"湧浪","s":"Surfers were excited about the big ________ that arrived after the storm, but the lifeguards warned beginners to stay out.","zh":"衝浪者對暴風雨過後來的大湧浪感到興奮,但救生員警告初學者不要下水。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A26","t":"湧浪"},{"w":"undertow","pos":"n.","def":"a strong current under the surface that pulls water away from the shore","cn":"退浪;底流","s":"The beach looked calm, but a dangerous ________ pulled the swimmer away from the shore, so a lifeguard had to rescue him.","zh":"海灘看起來很平靜,但危險的底流把泳客拉離岸邊,所以救生員必須救他。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A27","t":"底流"},{"w":"tsunami","pos":"n.","def":"a very large wave caused by an earthquake under the sea","cn":"海嘯","s":"After the earthquake, a ________ warning was sent to everyone's phones, and families quickly moved to higher ground.","zh":"地震之後,海嘯警報發送到每個人的手機,家家戶戶迅速移往高處。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A28","t":"海嘯"},{"w":"offshore","pos":"adj.","def":"located in the sea, away from the coast","cn":"離岸的;近海的","s":"The government plans to build more ________ wind farms, because the wind at sea is stronger and more reliable.","zh":"政府計畫興建更多離岸風場,因為海上的風更強、更穩定。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A29","t":"離岸"},{"w":"inshore","pos":"adj.","def":"in the sea but close to the land","cn":"近岸的","s":"________ fishing boats are small, so they usually stay close to the coast and return to the harbour every evening.","zh":"近岸漁船很小,所以通常待在海岸附近,而且每天傍晚返回港口。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A30","t":"近岸"},{"w":"maritime","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with the sea or ships","cn":"海事的;航海的","s":"Taiwan has a long ________ history, and the museum in Keelung shows how people traded by sea centuries ago.","zh":"台灣有悠久的海洋歷史,而基隆的博物館展示了幾百年前人們如何透過海路貿易。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A31","t":"海洋"},{"w":"oceanic","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to the ocean","cn":"海洋的","s":"________ islands like Hawaii were formed by volcanoes, so their plants and animals arrived from far away.","zh":"像夏威夷這樣的海洋島嶼是由火山形成的,所以島上的動植物是從遠方來的。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A32","t":"海洋"},{"w":"cove","pos":"n.","def":"a small, sheltered bay","cn":"小海灣","s":"We found a hidden ________ with clear blue water, and we spent the whole afternoon swimming there without other tourists.","zh":"我們發現了一個海水清澈湛藍的隱密小海灣,整個下午都在那裡游泳,沒有其他遊客。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A33","t":"小海灣"},{"w":"high seas","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the open ocean that no country controls","cn":"公海","s":"Fishing on the ______ ______ is hard to control because no single country owns those waters.","zh":"在公海捕魚很難管控,因為沒有任何單一國家擁有那片水域。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Zones & Geography 海洋分區與地理","lab":"A34","t":"公海"},{"w":"plankton","pos":"n.","def":"tiny plants and animals that float in the sea","cn":"浮游生物","s":"Many large whales eat ________, although these tiny living things are almost too small to see.","zh":"許多大型鯨魚以浮游生物為食,儘管這些微小的生物小到幾乎看不見。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A35","t":"浮游生物"},{"w":"phytoplankton","pos":"n.","def":"tiny plants that float in the sea and use sunlight","cn":"浮游植物","s":"________ produces a large part of the oxygen we breathe, so the health of the ocean matters to everyone.","zh":"浮游植物製造了我們呼吸的大部分氧氣,所以海洋的健康對每個人都很重要。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A36","t":"浮游植物"},{"w":"zooplankton","pos":"n.","def":"tiny animals that float in the sea","cn":"浮游動物","s":"Small fish feed on ________ at night, and then bigger fish come to hunt those small fish.","zh":"小魚在夜間以浮游動物為食,然後更大的魚會來獵捕那些小魚。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A37","t":"浮游動物"},{"w":"krill","pos":"n.","def":"small shrimp-like animals eaten by whales and penguins","cn":"磷蝦","s":"Blue whales can eat four tonnes of ________ a day, so they need huge areas of rich, cold water.","zh":"藍鯨一天可以吃掉四噸的磷蝦,所以牠們需要廣大、豐富又寒冷的水域。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A38","t":"磷蝦"},{"w":"jellyfish","pos":"n.","def":"a soft sea animal with long parts that can sting","cn":"水母","s":"My sister was stung by a ________ while she was swimming, so we put vinegar on her arm right away.","zh":"我妹妹游泳時被水母螫到,所以我們立刻在她手臂上塗醋。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A39","t":"水母"},{"w":"octopus","pos":"n.","def":"a sea animal with a soft body and eight arms","cn":"章魚","s":"The ________ can change its colour in seconds, and it often hides between rocks to avoid hungry predators.","zh":"章魚能在幾秒內改變顏色,而且牠常常躲在岩石之間躲避飢餓的掠食者。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A40","t":"章魚"},{"w":"squid","pos":"n.","def":"a sea animal with ten arms and a long body","cn":"魷魚","s":"Fishermen use bright lights at night to attract ________, and the boats look like floating stars from the shore.","zh":"漁民在夜間使用明亮的燈光吸引魷魚,從岸邊看,那些船就像漂浮的星星。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A41","t":"魷魚"},{"w":"crustacean","pos":"n.","def":"an animal with a hard shell, such as a crab or shrimp","cn":"甲殼類動物","s":"A crab is a ________, so it has a hard shell, and it must grow a new one as its body gets bigger.","zh":"螃蟹是甲殼類動物,所以牠有堅硬的殼,而且當身體長大時必須長出新殼。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A42","t":"甲殼類動物"},{"w":"crab","pos":"n.","def":"a sea animal with a shell, eight legs and two claws","cn":"螃蟹","s":"The little ________ walked sideways across the sand, and it quickly disappeared into a hole when we came closer.","zh":"那隻小螃蟹橫著走過沙灘,我們靠近時牠迅速消失在一個洞裡。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A43","t":"螃蟹"},{"w":"lobster","pos":"n.","def":"a large shellfish with big claws that people eat","cn":"龍蝦","s":"________ is an expensive dish in many restaurants, but some people refuse to eat it because they worry about overfishing.","zh":"龍蝦在許多餐廳是昂貴的菜餚,但有些人拒絕吃,因為他們擔心過度捕撈。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A44","t":"龍蝦"},{"w":"shellfish","pos":"n.","def":"sea animals with shells that people eat, like clams and shrimp","cn":"貝類;有殼海鮮","s":"My uncle cannot eat ________ because it makes his skin itchy, so he always orders fish instead.","zh":"我叔叔不能吃有殼海鮮,因為那會讓他皮膚發癢,所以他總是改點魚。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A45","t":"有殼海鮮"},{"w":"mollusc","pos":"n.","def":"a soft animal often with a shell, like a snail or octopus","cn":"軟體動物","s":"An octopus is a ________ without a shell, while a snail is one that carries its shell on its back.","zh":"章魚是沒有殼的軟體動物,而蝸牛則是背著殼的軟體動物。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A46","t":"軟體動物"},{"w":"clam","pos":"n.","def":"a shellfish with two shells that close tightly","cn":"蛤蜊","s":"We dug ________ out of the wet sand at low tide, and my grandmother cooked them in a delicious soup.","zh":"我們在退潮時從濕沙裡挖出蛤蜊,而奶奶把牠們煮成美味的湯。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A47","t":"蛤蜊"},{"w":"oyster","pos":"n.","def":"a shellfish that can make pearls and is often eaten raw","cn":"牡蠣;蚵仔","s":"Changhua is famous for its ________ farms, and visitors love to try the local oyster omelettes.","zh":"彰化以牡蠣養殖場聞名,而遊客喜歡品嚐當地的蚵仔煎。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A48","t":"牡蠣"},{"w":"sea urchin","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a small round sea animal covered in sharp spines","cn":"海膽","s":"Wear shoes when you walk on the rocks, because a ______ ______ can hurt your feet badly with its sharp spines.","zh":"在岩石上走路時要穿鞋,因為海膽會用牠尖銳的刺嚴重刺傷你的腳。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A49","t":"海膽"},{"w":"starfish","pos":"n.","def":"a flat sea animal shaped like a star","cn":"海星","s":"The children found a bright orange ________ in a rock pool, but their teacher asked them to put it back gently.","zh":"孩子們在潮池裡發現一隻鮮橘色的海星,但老師請他們輕輕地把牠放回去。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A50","t":"海星"},{"w":"sponge","pos":"n.","def":"a simple sea animal with a body full of holes","cn":"海綿","s":"A ________ looks like a plant, but it is actually an animal that filters food from the water.","zh":"海綿看起來像植物,但牠其實是從水中過濾食物的動物。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A51","t":"海綿"},{"w":"seahorse","pos":"n.","def":"a small fish with a head shaped like a horse","cn":"海馬","s":"The male ________ carries the babies in a pouch, and this makes it very unusual in the animal world.","zh":"雄海馬把寶寶放在育兒袋中,這讓牠在動物界中非常特別。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A52","t":"海馬"},{"w":"shark","pos":"n.","def":"a large fish with sharp teeth","cn":"鯊魚","s":"Many people fear the ________, but it rarely attacks humans, and millions are killed every year for their fins.","zh":"許多人害怕鯊魚,但牠很少攻擊人類,而且每年有數百萬隻因為魚鰭而被殺。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A53","t":"鯊魚"},{"w":"whale","pos":"n.","def":"a very large sea mammal","cn":"鯨魚","s":"We took a boat trip from Hualien to see a ________, and we were lucky enough to watch one jump out of the water.","zh":"我們從花蓮搭船出海去看鯨魚,而且很幸運地看到一隻躍出水面。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A54","t":"鯨魚"},{"w":"dolphin","pos":"n.","def":"an intelligent sea mammal with a long nose","cn":"海豚","s":"A group of ________ swam next to our boat, and they seemed to enjoy playing in the waves.","zh":"一群海豚在我們的船旁邊游泳,牠們似乎很享受在浪中嬉戲。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A55","t":"海豚"},{"w":"seal","pos":"n.","def":"a sea mammal with flippers that lives in cold places","cn":"海豹","s":"A ________ was lying on the rocks in the sun, and it did not seem worried by the tourists taking photos.","zh":"一隻海豹躺在岩石上曬太陽,而且牠似乎一點也不在意拍照的遊客。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A56","t":"海豹"},{"w":"sea turtle","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a large turtle that lives in the ocean","cn":"海龜","s":"A ______ ______ swam slowly past us while we were snorkelling off Xiaoliuqiu, and we kept a respectful distance.","zh":"我們在小琉球外海浮潛時,一隻海龜慢慢游過我們身邊,我們保持了尊重的距離。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A57","t":"海龜"},{"w":"seabird","pos":"n.","def":"a bird that lives near the sea and eats fish","cn":"海鳥","s":"The ________ dived into the water to catch a fish, but it accidentally swallowed a piece of plastic too.","zh":"那隻海鳥衝進水裡抓魚,但牠也不小心吞下了一片塑膠。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A58","t":"海鳥"},{"w":"penguin","pos":"n.","def":"a black and white sea bird that cannot fly but swims well","cn":"企鵝","s":"A ________ cannot fly, but it is an excellent swimmer, so it can catch fish easily under the ice.","zh":"企鵝不會飛,但牠是很棒的游泳者,所以能輕鬆地在冰下捕魚。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A59","t":"企鵝"},{"w":"gill","pos":"n.","def":"the part of a fish used for breathing in water","cn":"鰓","s":"Fish breathe through their ________, so they can take oxygen from the water but cannot live in the air.","zh":"魚透過鰓呼吸,所以牠們能從水中取得氧氣,但無法在空氣中存活。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A60","t":"鰓"},{"w":"fin","pos":"n.","def":"a thin flat part of a fish that helps it swim","cn":"鰭","s":"We saw a dark ________ above the water and thought it was a shark, but it turned out to be a friendly dolphin.","zh":"我們看到水面上有一個深色的鰭,以為是鯊魚,但結果是一隻友善的海豚。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A61","t":"鰭"},{"w":"tentacle","pos":"n.","def":"a long, thin arm of an animal like an octopus or jellyfish","cn":"觸手","s":"The jellyfish's ________ can be several metres long, so swimmers may be stung without even seeing it.","zh":"水母的觸手可能長達好幾公尺,所以泳客甚至沒看到牠就可能被螫。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A62","t":"觸手"},{"w":"shell","pos":"n.","def":"the hard outer cover of some animals","cn":"殼;貝殼","s":"My little brother collected a beautiful ________ from the beach, but I reminded him that some crabs need them as homes.","zh":"我弟弟從海灘撿了一個美麗的貝殼,但我提醒他有些螃蟹需要它們當家。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A63","t":"貝殼"},{"w":"blubber","pos":"n.","def":"the thick layer of fat under the skin of whales and seals","cn":"鯨脂;脂肪層","s":"Seals have a thick layer of ________ under their skin, so they can stay warm in icy water.","zh":"海豹皮膚下有一層厚厚的脂肪層,所以牠們能在冰冷的水中保暖。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A64","t":"脂肪層"},{"w":"school","pos":"n.","def":"a large group of fish swimming together","cn":"魚群","s":"A huge ________ of silver fish moved together like one animal, and it quickly changed direction when a shark appeared.","zh":"一大群銀色的魚群像一隻動物般一起移動,而且當鯊魚出現時迅速改變方向。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A65","t":"魚群"},{"w":"filter feeder","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an animal that eats by straining tiny food from water","cn":"濾食動物","s":"The whale shark is a ______ ______, so although it is huge, it only eats tiny plankton and small fish.","zh":"鯨鯊是濾食動物,所以雖然牠很巨大,但只吃微小的浮游生物和小魚。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A66","t":"濾食動物"},{"w":"bioluminescent","pos":"adj.","def":"able to produce its own light","cn":"生物發光的","s":"The waves glowed blue at night because of ________ plankton, and tourists came from far away to see it.","zh":"因為會發光的浮游生物,海浪在夜裡發出藍光,遊客從遠方前來觀賞。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A67","t":"會發光的"},{"w":"aquatic","pos":"adj.","def":"living or growing in water","cn":"水生的","s":"Frogs begin life as ________ animals, but adult frogs can live on land as well as in water.","zh":"青蛙一開始是水生動物,但成蛙既能在水中也能在陸地上生活。","part":"A","sec":"Marine Life 海洋生物","lab":"A68","t":"水生"},{"w":"polyp","pos":"n.","def":"a tiny soft animal that builds coral","cn":"珊瑚蟲;水螅體","s":"Each coral ________ is smaller than a grain of rice, but millions of them together can build a huge reef.","zh":"每一隻珊瑚蟲都比一粒米還小,但數百萬隻聚在一起就能建造巨大的珊瑚礁。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A69","t":"珊瑚蟲"},{"w":"symbiosis","pos":"n.","def":"a close relationship between two living things that helps both","cn":"共生","s":"Coral and tiny algae live in ________, because the algae make food for the coral while the coral gives them a safe home.","zh":"珊瑚和微小的藻類處於共生關係,因為藻類為珊瑚製造食物,而珊瑚給它們一個安全的家。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A70","t":"共生"},{"w":"symbiotic","pos":"adj.","def":"helping each other by living closely together","cn":"共生的","s":"The clownfish and the anemone have a ________ relationship, so the fish gets protection while the anemone gets cleaned.","zh":"小丑魚和海葵有共生關係,所以魚得到保護,而海葵得到清潔。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A71","t":"共生"},{"w":"kelp","pos":"n.","def":"a very large, brown seaweed","cn":"海帶;巨藻","s":"Sea otters live among tall ________ in California, and they often wrap themselves in it so they do not float away while sleeping.","zh":"海獺生活在加州高大的巨藻間,而且牠們常把自己纏在裡面,這樣睡覺時才不會漂走。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A72","t":"巨藻"},{"w":"seaweed","pos":"n.","def":"a plant that grows in the sea","cn":"海草;海藻","s":"Many Asian dishes use dried ________, and it is also becoming popular as a healthy snack in Western countries.","zh":"許多亞洲料理使用乾海苔,而它在西方國家也逐漸成為受歡迎的健康零食。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A73","t":"海苔"},{"w":"seagrass","pos":"n.","def":"grass-like plants that grow in shallow sea water","cn":"海草床植物;海草","s":"Green turtles feed on ________ in shallow bays, so protecting these underwater meadows also protects the turtles.","zh":"綠蠵龜在淺海灣以海草為食,所以保護這些水下草原也就保護了海龜。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A74","t":"海草"},{"w":"tide pool","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a small pool of sea water left among rocks at low tide","cn":"潮池","s":"The children spent the morning looking into a ______ ______, and they found tiny fish, crabs and sea snails.","zh":"孩子們整個早上都在觀察一個潮池,他們發現了小魚、螃蟹和海螺。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A75","t":"潮池"},{"w":"sandbar","pos":"n.","def":"a long pile of sand in the sea near the coast","cn":"沙洲","s":"Our boat got stuck on a ________ at low tide, so we had to wait two hours for the water to rise again.","zh":"我們的船在退潮時卡在沙洲上,所以我們必須等兩個小時讓海水再次上漲。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A76","t":"沙洲"},{"w":"dune","pos":"n.","def":"a hill of sand formed by the wind","cn":"沙丘","s":"Grass helps hold each ________ in place, so visitors are asked not to walk on the plants near the beach.","zh":"草有助於讓每座沙丘保持在原位,所以遊客被要求不要踩踏海灘附近的植物。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A77","t":"沙丘"},{"w":"intertidal","pos":"adj.","def":"between the high and low tide lines","cn":"潮間帶的","s":"Animals in the ________ zone must survive both dry air and sea water, because the tide covers them only part of the day.","zh":"潮間帶的動物必須在乾燥的空氣和海水中都能存活,因為潮水一天只淹沒牠們一段時間。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A78","t":"潮間帶"},{"w":"salt marsh","pos":"n.phr.","def":"wet coastal land covered with grass and flooded by the tide","cn":"鹽沼","s":"The ______ ______ protects the village from storms, and it also provides food for thousands of birds every winter.","zh":"鹽沼保護村莊免受暴風侵襲,而且每年冬天也為數千隻鳥提供食物。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A79","t":"鹽沼"},{"w":"cliff","pos":"n.","def":"a high, steep rock face, often by the sea","cn":"懸崖;峭壁","s":"Seabirds build their nests on the ________ above the sea, so foxes and other animals cannot reach their eggs.","zh":"海鳥在海面上的懸崖築巢,所以狐狸和其他動物碰不到牠們的蛋。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A80","t":"懸崖"},{"w":"shore","pos":"n.","def":"the land along the edge of the sea","cn":"岸邊;海岸","s":"We walked along the ________ at sunset, and we watched the fishing boats coming back into the harbour.","zh":"我們在日落時沿著海岸散步,看著漁船駛回港口。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A81","t":"海岸"},{"w":"pebble","pos":"n.","def":"a small, smooth, round stone","cn":"鵝卵石","s":"The beach at Qixingtan is covered with ________ instead of sand, so it makes a lovely sound when the waves pull back.","zh":"七星潭的海灘上覆蓋著鵝卵石而不是沙子,所以當海浪退去時會發出美妙的聲音。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A82","t":"鵝卵石"},{"w":"barnacle","pos":"n.","def":"a small sea animal that sticks to rocks and ships","cn":"藤壺","s":"Thousands of ________ grew on the bottom of the boat, so it moved more slowly and used more fuel.","zh":"數千隻藤壺長在船底,所以船移動得更慢,而且耗費更多燃料。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A83","t":"藤壺"},{"w":"anemone","pos":"n.","def":"a sea animal with many soft arms that looks like a flower","cn":"海葵","s":"The ________ looks like a colourful flower, but its soft arms can sting small fish that swim too close.","zh":"海葵看起來像一朵色彩繽紛的花,但它柔軟的觸手會螫傷游得太近的小魚。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A84","t":"海葵"},{"w":"clownfish","pos":"n.","def":"a small orange and white fish that lives in anemones","cn":"小丑魚","s":"After the famous cartoon came out, many children wanted a ________ as a pet, and wild numbers dropped in some places.","zh":"那部知名卡通上映後,許多孩子想要養小丑魚當寵物,而某些地方的野生數量因此下降。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A85","t":"小丑魚"},{"w":"sea cucumber","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a soft sea animal shaped like a cucumber that lives on the sea floor","cn":"海參","s":"A ______ ______ cleans the sea floor by eating sand and waste, but it is overharvested because some people consider it a luxury food.","zh":"海參藉由吃沙子和廢物來清潔海床,但牠被過度採集,因為有些人把牠當作高級食材。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A86","t":"海參"},{"w":"spawn","pos":"v.","def":"to produce eggs in large numbers (of fish and other water animals)","cn":"產卵","s":"Corals ________ on just a few nights each year, and divers travel far to see the water fill with tiny eggs.","zh":"珊瑚每年只在少數幾個夜晚產卵,而潛水員遠道而來觀看海水充滿微小的卵。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A87","t":"產卵"},{"w":"larva","pos":"n.","def":"a very young form of an animal before it changes into an adult","cn":"幼體;幼蟲","s":"Each coral ________ drifts in the ocean for days, and then it settles on a rock to start a new colony.","zh":"每一隻珊瑚幼體在海洋中漂流好幾天,然後它會附著在岩石上開始一個新的群體。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A88","t":"幼體"},{"w":"nursery","pos":"n.","def":"a place where young animals grow up safely","cn":"育幼場","s":"Mangrove roots are a ________ for young fish, because larger fish cannot swim between the thick roots.","zh":"紅樹林的根部是幼魚的育幼場,因為較大的魚無法在茂密的根之間游動。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A89","t":"育幼場"},{"w":"limestone","pos":"n.","def":"a type of white or grey rock formed from shells and coral","cn":"石灰岩","s":"Kenting's coastline is made of ________ that was once an ancient coral reef, and you can still see fossils in the rocks.","zh":"墾丁的海岸線是由曾經是古老珊瑚礁的石灰岩構成的,而你仍能在岩石中看到化石。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A90","t":"石灰岩"},{"w":"skeleton","pos":"n.","def":"the hard structure that supports a body","cn":"骨骼","s":"When coral dies, its white ________ remains on the reef, but seaweed soon grows over it.","zh":"珊瑚死亡時,它白色的骨骼會留在礁上,但海藻很快就會長滿在上面。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A91","t":"骨骼"},{"w":"calcium","pos":"n.","def":"a chemical element found in bones, shells and coral","cn":"鈣","s":"Coral uses ________ from sea water to build its hard skeleton, but warmer, more acidic water makes this harder.","zh":"珊瑚利用海水中的鈣建造堅硬的骨骼,但更溫暖、更酸的海水讓這件事變得更困難。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A92","t":"鈣"},{"w":"snorkel","pos":"v.","def":"to swim near the surface with a tube to breathe through","cn":"浮潛","s":"We went to ________ near Green Island, and we saw colourful fish only a few metres from the beach.","zh":"我們到綠島附近浮潛,而且在離海灘只有幾公尺的地方就看到色彩繽紛的魚。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A93","t":"浮潛"},{"w":"scuba diving","pos":"n.phr.","def":"swimming deep underwater with an air tank","cn":"水肺潛水","s":"My cousin took a ______ ______ course last summer, and now she can explore reefs twenty metres underwater.","zh":"我表姊去年夏天上了水肺潛水課程,現在她可以探索水下二十公尺的珊瑚礁。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A94","t":"水肺潛水"},{"w":"no-take zone","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a sea area where all fishing and collecting are banned","cn":"禁漁區","s":"Fishing is completely banned in the ______ ______, so fish numbers there have grown quickly over the past ten years.","zh":"在禁漁區內完全禁止捕魚,所以那裡的魚群數量在過去十年快速成長。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A95","t":"禁漁區"},{"w":"lifeguard","pos":"n.","def":"a person whose job is to watch and rescue swimmers","cn":"救生員","s":"The ________ blew his whistle loudly, because a group of teenagers were swimming outside the safe area.","zh":"救生員大聲吹哨,因為一群青少年在安全區域外游泳。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A96","t":"救生員"},{"w":"rip current","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a strong current that flows quickly away from the beach","cn":"離岸流","s":"If a ______ ______ pulls you out to sea, swim parallel to the beach instead of fighting against the water.","zh":"如果離岸流把你拉向外海,要與海灘平行地游,而不是逆著水流掙扎。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A97","t":"離岸流"},{"w":"breakwater","pos":"n.","def":"a wall built into the sea to protect a harbour from waves","cn":"防波堤","s":"The new ________ protects the harbour from big waves, but some people worry that it has changed the beach nearby.","zh":"新的防波堤保護港口不受大浪侵襲,但有些人擔心它改變了附近的海灘。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A98","t":"防波堤"},{"w":"pier","pos":"n.","def":"a long structure built from the land out over the sea","cn":"碼頭;突堤","s":"We walked to the end of the ________ to watch the sunset, and an old man there was fishing quietly.","zh":"我們走到碼頭盡頭看夕陽,那裡有一位老人正安靜地釣魚。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A99","t":"碼頭"},{"w":"lighthouse","pos":"n.","def":"a tower with a bright light that warns ships of danger","cn":"燈塔","s":"The old ________ at Eluanbi has guided ships for over a hundred years, and it is now a popular tourist spot.","zh":"鵝鑾鼻的老燈塔已經為船隻導航超過一百年,而它現在是熱門的觀光景點。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A100","t":"燈塔"},{"w":"shoal","pos":"n.","def":"a large group of fish swimming together","cn":"魚群","s":"A ________ of sardines turned silver in the sunlight, and the divers watched as it twisted and turned around them.","zh":"一群沙丁魚魚群在陽光下閃著銀光,潛水員看著牠們在身邊扭轉迴旋。","part":"A","sec":"Coral Reefs & Coastal Habitats 珊瑚礁與海岸棲地","lab":"A101","t":"魚群"},{"w":"oceanography","pos":"n.","def":"the scientific study of the ocean","cn":"海洋學","s":"My cousin is studying ________ at university, and she spends a month at sea every year collecting water samples.","zh":"我表姊在大學讀海洋學,而且她每年都會在海上待一個月採集海水樣本。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A102","t":"海洋學"},{"w":"oceanographer","pos":"n.","def":"a scientist who studies the ocean","cn":"海洋學家","s":"An ________ explained on TV that the ocean is getting warmer, and she warned that fish are moving to cooler waters.","zh":"一位海洋學家在電視上解釋海洋正在變暖,而且她警告魚類正遷往較涼的水域。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A103","t":"海洋學家"},{"w":"marine biologist","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a scientist who studies living things in the sea","cn":"海洋生物學家","s":"I want to become a ______ ______ because I love sea animals, and I hope to help protect coral reefs one day.","zh":"我想成為海洋生物學家,因為我熱愛海洋動物,而且我希望有一天能幫忙保護珊瑚礁。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A104","t":"海洋生物學家"},{"w":"submarine","pos":"n.","def":"a ship that can travel underwater","cn":"潛水艇","s":"The tourist ________ took us forty metres under the sea, and we watched sharks through the large windows.","zh":"觀光潛水艇帶我們到海面下四十公尺,我們透過大窗戶觀看鯊魚。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A105","t":"潛水艇"},{"w":"submersible","pos":"n.","def":"a small underwater vehicle used for research","cn":"深潛器","s":"The scientists used a ________ to reach the deep sea floor, because divers cannot survive the pressure there.","zh":"科學家使用深潛器抵達深海海床,因為潛水員無法承受那裡的壓力。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A106","t":"深潛器"},{"w":"sonar","pos":"n.","def":"a system that uses sound to find objects underwater","cn":"聲納","s":"The ship used ________ to map the sea floor, but scientists worry that the loud sounds may confuse whales.","zh":"這艘船使用聲納繪製海床地圖,但科學家擔心巨大的聲響可能讓鯨魚感到混亂。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A107","t":"聲納"},{"w":"buoy","pos":"n.","def":"a floating object in the sea used as a marker or to measure things","cn":"浮標","s":"A yellow ________ floats above the reef to show boats where they can tie up, so they do not drop anchors on the coral.","zh":"一個黃色浮標漂浮在珊瑚礁上方,告訴船隻可以在哪裡繫泊,這樣它們就不會把錨丟在珊瑚上。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A108","t":"浮標"},{"w":"probe","pos":"n.","def":"a tool sent to collect information from a place that is hard to reach","cn":"探測器","s":"Researchers lowered a ________ into the deep water, and it sent back data about temperature and oxygen levels.","zh":"研究人員把探測器放入深水中,它傳回有關溫度和氧氣含量的數據。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A109","t":"探測器"},{"w":"expedition","pos":"n.","def":"an organised journey to explore or study something","cn":"探險;考察","s":"The team went on a three-month ________ to Antarctica, and they discovered several new kinds of sea creatures.","zh":"團隊前往南極進行為期三個月的考察,而且他們發現了好幾種新的海洋生物。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A110","t":"考察"},{"w":"explorer","pos":"n.","def":"a person who travels to unknown places to learn about them","cn":"探險家","s":"The famous ocean ________ spent his life studying the sea, and his films made millions of people love marine life.","zh":"這位著名的海洋探險家一生都在研究海洋,而他的影片讓數百萬人愛上海洋生物。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A111","t":"探險家"},{"w":"navigate","pos":"v.","def":"to find the way when travelling, especially by sea","cn":"導航;航行","s":"Ancient sailors used the stars to ________ across the Pacific, although they had no maps or modern instruments.","zh":"古代水手利用星星航行橫越太平洋,儘管他們沒有地圖或現代儀器。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A112","t":"航行"},{"w":"navigation","pos":"n.","def":"the skill of planning and following a route","cn":"導航;航海術","s":"Modern ________ depends on satellites, but sailors still learn to use maps in case the electronic system fails.","zh":"現代導航仰賴衛星,但水手仍然學習使用地圖,以防電子系統故障。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A113","t":"導航"},{"w":"voyage","pos":"n.","def":"a long journey by sea","cn":"航程;航行","s":"The ________ from Taiwan to Japan took three days, and many passengers felt seasick during the stormy weather.","zh":"從台灣到日本的航程花了三天,而且許多乘客在暴風雨天氣中感到暈船。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A114","t":"航程"},{"w":"vessel","pos":"n.","def":"a ship or large boat","cn":"船隻;船艦","s":"The research ________ carries a small lab, so scientists can study samples while they are still at sea.","zh":"這艘研究船上載有一間小實驗室,所以科學家仍在海上時就能研究樣本。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A115","t":"船"},{"w":"crew","pos":"n.","def":"the people who work on a ship","cn":"船員;全體工作人員","s":"The ________ worked through the night to repair the engine, because the ship was drifting toward dangerous rocks.","zh":"船員們徹夜工作修理引擎,因為船正漂向危險的岩石。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A116","t":"船員"},{"w":"deep-sea","pos":"adj.","def":"found or happening in the deepest parts of the ocean","cn":"深海的","s":"________ fish often look strange, and some have glowing lights that help them catch food in the dark.","zh":"深海魚常常長得很奇特,而且有些有發光器幫助牠們在黑暗中捕捉食物。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A117","t":"深海"},{"w":"water pressure","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the force of water pushing on something","cn":"水壓","s":"______ ______ increases as you go deeper, so divers must come up slowly to stay safe.","zh":"水壓會隨著你潛得越深而增加,所以潛水員必須慢慢上升才能保持安全。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A118","t":"水壓"},{"w":"sediment","pos":"n.","def":"sand, mud and stones that settle at the bottom of water","cn":"沉積物","s":"Scientists study ________ from the sea floor, because it holds clues about the climate thousands of years ago.","zh":"科學家研究海床的沉積物,因為它保存了數千年前氣候的線索。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A119","t":"沉積物"},{"w":"chart","pos":"v.","def":"to make a map of an area, especially of the sea","cn":"繪製(海)圖","s":"Early sailors had to ________ the coastline carefully, because hidden rocks could easily sink their ships.","zh":"早期水手必須仔細繪製海岸線的地圖,因為隱藏的礁石很容易讓船沉沒。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A120","t":"繪製"},{"w":"dive","pos":"v.","def":"to go under water, often with special equipment","cn":"潛水","s":"We plan to ________ near the shipwreck tomorrow, but the trip will be cancelled if the sea is too rough.","zh":"我們計畫明天在沉船附近潛水,但如果海象太差,行程就會取消。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A121","t":"潛水"},{"w":"diver","pos":"n.","def":"a person who swims underwater, often for work or sport","cn":"潛水員","s":"The ________ checked his air tank twice before jumping in, because a small mistake can be very dangerous underwater.","zh":"那位潛水員跳下水前檢查了他的氣瓶兩次,因為在水下一個小錯誤就可能非常危險。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A122","t":"潛水員"},{"w":"wetsuit","pos":"n.","def":"a tight rubber suit that keeps you warm in water","cn":"潛水衣;防寒衣","s":"The water was only eighteen degrees, so I wore a thick ________ and stayed warm for the whole dive.","zh":"海水只有十八度,所以我穿了一件厚防寒衣,整趟潛水都保持溫暖。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A123","t":"防寒衣"},{"w":"underwater","pos":"adj.","def":"below the surface of water","cn":"水下的;水中的","s":"She bought an ________ camera before her holiday, and she took amazing photos of turtles and coral.","zh":"她在假期前買了一台水下相機,而且拍了很棒的海龜和珊瑚照片。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A124","t":"水下"},{"w":"satellite","pos":"n.","def":"a machine in space that sends information back to Earth","cn":"衛星","s":"Data from a ________ shows that sea temperatures are rising, so scientists can warn reef managers in advance.","zh":"來自衛星的數據顯示海水溫度正在上升,所以科學家能事先警告珊瑚礁管理人員。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A125","t":"衛星"},{"w":"uncharted","pos":"adj.","def":"not yet mapped or explored","cn":"未知的;海圖上未標明的","s":"Large parts of the sea floor are still ________, so explorers may discover new mountains and canyons in the future.","zh":"海床的大部分地區仍然未被繪製,所以探險家未來可能會發現新的山脈和峽谷。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A126","t":"未被繪製"},{"w":"unexplored","pos":"adj.","def":"not yet visited or studied","cn":"未探索的","s":"More than eighty percent of the ocean is ________, and scientists believe millions of species are still unknown.","zh":"超過百分之八十的海洋尚未被探索,而且科學家相信仍有數百萬個物種不為人知。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A127","t":"尚未被探索"},{"w":"compass","pos":"n.","def":"a tool with a needle that always points north","cn":"指南針;羅盤","s":"The sailor checked his ________ because the clouds were hiding the stars, and he did not want to lose his way.","zh":"那名水手查看他的指南針,因為雲層遮住了星星,而他不想迷失方向。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A128","t":"指南針"},{"w":"anchor","pos":"n.","def":"a heavy metal object dropped to stop a boat from moving","cn":"錨","s":"Boats should never drop an ________ on coral, because it can break plants and animals that took years to grow.","zh":"船隻絕不應該把錨丟在珊瑚上,因為它會破壞花了好幾年才長成的動植物。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A129","t":"錨"},{"w":"hull","pos":"n.","def":"the main body of a ship","cn":"船身;船體","s":"The ________ of the ship was damaged by rocks, so water began to come in and the crew called for help.","zh":"船的船體被岩石撞壞,所以海水開始流入,船員發出求救訊號。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A130","t":"船體"},{"w":"harbour","pos":"n.","def":"a sheltered area of water where ships can stay safely","cn":"港口;港灣","s":"All the fishing boats returned to the ________ before the typhoon arrived, and the fishermen tied them together tightly.","zh":"所有漁船在颱風來臨前回到港口,漁民們把船緊緊地綁在一起。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A131","t":"港口"},{"w":"sink / sank / sunk","pos":"v.","def":"to go down below the surface of water","cn":"下沉;沉沒","s":"The old ship hit an iceberg and ________ in less than three hours, so many passengers did not have time to escape.","zh":"那艘老船撞上冰山,不到三小時就沉沒了,所以許多乘客來不及逃生。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A132","t":"沉沒"},{"w":"shipwreck","pos":"n.","def":"the remains of a ship that has sunk","cn":"沉船;船骸","s":"The ________ has become an artificial reef, and divers love to see the fish living inside it.","zh":"這艘沉船已經成為人工魚礁,而潛水員喜歡觀看住在裡面的魚。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A133","t":"沉船"},{"w":"salvage","pos":"v.","def":"to save goods or a ship from damage or the sea","cn":"打撈;搶救","s":"The company tried to ________ the cargo from the sunken ship, but strong currents made the work very slow.","zh":"公司試著從沉船中打撈貨物,但強勁的海流讓工作進行得非常緩慢。","part":"A","sec":"Ocean Science & Exploration 海洋科學與探索","lab":"A134","t":"打撈"},{"w":"microplastic","pos":"n.","def":"a very small piece of plastic less than 5 mm long","cn":"塑膠微粒","s":"Scientists found ________ in the stomachs of many fish, and some of these tiny pieces may end up in our food.","zh":"科學家在許多魚的胃裡發現塑膠微粒,而這些微小碎片有些可能最後進入我們的食物。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A135","t":"塑膠微粒"},{"w":"oil spill","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an accident in which oil escapes into the sea","cn":"漏油;油污外洩","s":"The ______ ______ covered the beach in black oil, and volunteers spent weeks cleaning birds and rocks.","zh":"漏油讓海灘覆蓋上黑色的油,志工們花了好幾週清洗鳥類和岩石。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A136","t":"漏油"},{"w":"runoff","pos":"n.","def":"rain water that flows from land into rivers and the sea, carrying dirt and chemicals","cn":"地表逕流","s":"Farm ________ carries fertiliser into the sea after heavy rain, so harmful algae can grow very quickly.","zh":"大雨過後,農田逕流把肥料帶入海中,所以有害的藻類會迅速生長。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A137","t":"逕流"},{"w":"sewage","pos":"n.","def":"dirty water and waste from toilets and drains","cn":"污水","s":"Some coastal towns still release ________ straight into the sea, so swimmers may get sick after a day at the beach.","zh":"一些沿海城鎮仍然把污水直接排入海中,所以泳客在海灘待一天後可能會生病。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A138","t":"污水"},{"w":"dump","pos":"v.","def":"to throw away waste in a careless or illegal way","cn":"傾倒;丟棄","s":"Some factories secretly ________ chemicals into rivers at night, but the waste still flows into the ocean.","zh":"有些工廠在夜間偷偷把化學物質傾倒到河裡,但這些廢物仍會流入海洋。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A139","t":"傾倒"},{"w":"beach clean-up","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an event where people collect rubbish from a beach","cn":"淨灘活動","s":"Our class joined a ______ ______ last Saturday, and we were shocked by how many bottle caps we found in the sand.","zh":"我們班上週六參加了淨灘活動,而我們對在沙子裡找到那麼多瓶蓋感到震驚。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A140","t":"淨灘活動"},{"w":"garbage patch","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a large area of the ocean where floating rubbish collects","cn":"垃圾帶","s":"The Great Pacific ______ ______ is not a solid island, but it contains millions of small pieces of floating plastic.","zh":"太平洋垃圾帶不是一座實心的島,但它含有數百萬片漂浮的小塑膠碎片。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A141","t":"垃圾帶"},{"w":"ghost net","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a fishing net that has been lost or left in the sea","cn":"幽靈漁網","s":"A ______ ______ can keep catching fish for years after it is lost, so divers work hard to remove them from reefs.","zh":"幽靈漁網遺失後仍能持續捕到魚好幾年,所以潛水員努力把它們從珊瑚礁上移除。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A142","t":"幽靈漁網"},{"w":"entangle","pos":"v.","def":"to catch something so that it cannot get free","cn":"纏住","s":"Old fishing lines can ________ turtles and seals, and many of these animals die because they cannot swim or eat.","zh":"舊的釣魚線可能纏住海龜和海豹,而許多這些動物因為無法游泳或進食而死亡。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A143","t":"纏住"},{"w":"dead zone","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an area of sea with too little oxygen for most life","cn":"死區;缺氧區","s":"Fertiliser has created a ______ ______ near the river mouth, and almost no fish can survive there in summer.","zh":"肥料在河口附近造成了一個死區,而夏天幾乎沒有魚能在那裡存活。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A144","t":"死區"},{"w":"hypoxia","pos":"n.","def":"a condition of having too little oxygen","cn":"缺氧","s":"________ in coastal waters is becoming more common, because warm water holds less oxygen than cold water.","zh":"沿岸水域的缺氧現象越來越常見,因為溫水所含的氧氣比冷水少。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A145","t":"缺氧"},{"w":"eutrophication","pos":"n.","def":"too many nutrients in water, which causes plants to grow too much","cn":"優養化","s":"________ happens when too many nutrients enter the water, so the lake turns green and fish begin to die.","zh":"當太多養分進入水中時就會發生優養化,所以湖水變綠,魚也開始死亡。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A146","t":"優養化"},{"w":"algal bloom","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a fast increase of algae in water","cn":"藻華","s":"An ______ ______ turned the water bright green, and the government closed the beach because the water was unsafe.","zh":"藻華讓海水變成鮮綠色,而政府關閉了海灘,因為海水不安全。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A147","t":"藻華"},{"w":"red tide","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a harmful algae bloom that makes the sea look red","cn":"赤潮;紅潮","s":"Shellfish from the area were banned during the ______ ______, because eating them could make people seriously ill.","zh":"紅潮期間禁止販售該地區的有殼海鮮,因為吃了可能讓人嚴重生病。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A148","t":"紅潮"},{"w":"toxin","pos":"n.","def":"a poisonous substance made by a living thing","cn":"毒素","s":"Some algae produce a ________ that builds up in shellfish, so people can get sick even when the seafood looks fresh.","zh":"有些藻類會產生在貝類體內累積的毒素,所以即使海鮮看起來很新鮮,人們還是可能生病。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A149","t":"毒素"},{"w":"mercury","pos":"n.","def":"a poisonous silver metal that can build up in fish","cn":"汞;水銀","s":"Large fish like tuna may contain ________, so doctors advise pregnant women to eat them only once in a while.","zh":"像鮪魚這樣的大型魚可能含有汞,所以醫生建議孕婦只偶爾吃。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A150","t":"汞"},{"w":"heavy metal","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a dangerous metal such as lead or mercury","cn":"重金屬","s":"A ______ ______ like lead can stay in the sea for a long time, and it slowly builds up in the bodies of marine animals.","zh":"像鉛這樣的重金屬能在海中停留很久,而且它會慢慢在海洋動物體內累積。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A151","t":"重金屬"},{"w":"noise pollution","pos":"n.phr.","def":"harmful or annoying levels of noise","cn":"噪音污染","s":"Ships create a lot of ______ ______ underwater, so whales find it harder to hear each other over long distances.","zh":"船隻在水下製造大量噪音污染,所以鯨魚更難在遠距離聽到彼此。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A152","t":"噪音污染"},{"w":"discharge","pos":"v.","def":"to let a liquid or gas flow out","cn":"排放","s":"Factories are not allowed to ________ hot water into the bay, because sudden warming can kill coral and fish.","zh":"工廠不准把熱水排放到海灣中,因為突然升溫會殺死珊瑚和魚類。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A153","t":"排放"},{"w":"dredge","pos":"v.","def":"to dig mud and sand from the bottom of a river, harbour or sea","cn":"疏浚;挖泥","s":"The port plans to ________ the harbour to let bigger ships in, but environmental groups say it will destroy seagrass.","zh":"港務單位計畫疏浚港口讓更大的船隻進入,但環保團體說這會破壞海草。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A154","t":"疏浚"},{"w":"ballast water","pos":"n.phr.","def":"sea water carried in a ship to keep it steady","cn":"壓艙水","s":"Ships carry ______ ______ from one country to another, so tiny foreign animals can be released into new seas.","zh":"船隻把壓艙水從一個國家帶到另一個國家,所以微小的外來生物可能被釋放到新的海域。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A155","t":"壓艙水"},{"w":"pathogen","pos":"n.","def":"a very small living thing that causes disease","cn":"病原體","s":"A new ________ has killed many starfish along the coast, and scientists think warmer water helped it spread.","zh":"一種新的病原體已經殺死沿岸許多海星,而科學家認為較溫暖的海水幫助它擴散。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A156","t":"病原體"},{"w":"single-use","pos":"adj.","def":"made to be used once and then thrown away","cn":"一次性的","s":"Our school stopped selling drinks in ________ bottles, and students now bring their own water bottles every day.","zh":"我們學校停止販售一次性瓶裝飲料,而學生們現在每天自己帶水瓶。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A157","t":"一次性"},{"w":"straw","pos":"n.","def":"a thin tube used for drinking","cn":"吸管","s":"Many cafés in Taipei have stopped giving out a plastic ________ with each drink, so customers use paper or metal ones instead.","zh":"台北許多咖啡店已經不再每杯飲料附上塑膠吸管,所以顧客改用紙製或金屬吸管。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A158","t":"吸管"},{"w":"packaging","pos":"n.","def":"the materials used to wrap or protect goods","cn":"包裝","s":"Online shopping creates a lot of ________, and much of this plastic ends up in rivers and then the sea.","zh":"網路購物產生大量包裝,而這些塑膠很多最後流入河川,然後進入海洋。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A159","t":"包裝"},{"w":"biodegradable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to break down naturally without harming nature","cn":"可生物分解的","s":"The shop uses ________ bags made from corn, so they break down naturally instead of polluting the ocean.","zh":"這家店使用玉米製成的可生物分解袋子,所以它們會自然分解,而不會污染海洋。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A160","t":"可生物分解"},{"w":"degrade","pos":"v.","def":"to break down slowly into smaller parts","cn":"分解;降解","s":"Plastic bottles take hundreds of years to ________, so the ones we throw away today will still be in the sea in 2400.","zh":"塑膠瓶需要數百年才能分解,所以我們今天丟掉的瓶子到了2400年仍會在海中。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A161","t":"分解"},{"w":"ingest","pos":"v.","def":"to take food or other things into the body","cn":"攝入;吞食","s":"Turtles often ________ plastic bags by mistake, because the bags look like jellyfish floating in the water.","zh":"海龜常常誤吞塑膠袋,因為袋子看起來就像漂浮在水中的水母。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A162","t":"吞"},{"w":"suffocate","pos":"v.","def":"to die because there is no air or oxygen","cn":"窒息","s":"Fish ________ when there is too little oxygen in the water, and thousands may wash up on the beach at once.","zh":"當水中氧氣太少時,魚會窒息,而且可能一次有數千條被沖上海灘。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A163","t":"窒息"},{"w":"choke","pos":"v.","def":"to be unable to breathe because something blocks the throat","cn":"噎住;嗆住","s":"Seabirds can ________ on bottle caps, because they mistake the bright plastic for small fish.","zh":"海鳥可能被瓶蓋噎住,因為牠們把鮮豔的塑膠誤認為小魚。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A164","t":"噎住"},{"w":"carcass","pos":"n.","def":"the dead body of an animal","cn":"屍體(動物)","s":"A whale ________ washed up on the beach last week, and scientists found more than twenty kilograms of plastic in its stomach.","zh":"上週一具鯨魚屍體被沖上海灘,而科學家在牠的胃裡發現超過二十公斤的塑膠。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A165","t":"屍體"},{"w":"strand","pos":"v.","def":"to leave a sea animal stuck on land and unable to return","cn":"使擱淺","s":"Low tides sometimes ________ dolphins on the beach, so local volunteers keep them wet until the water returns.","zh":"退潮有時會使海豚擱淺在海灘上,所以當地志工會讓牠們保持濕潤,直到海水回來。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A166","t":"擱淺"},{"w":"disposable","pos":"adj.","def":"made to be thrown away after use","cn":"拋棄式的;用完即丟的","s":"________ chopsticks and cups are convenient, but they create mountains of waste that often end up in the sea.","zh":"免洗筷子和杯子很方便,但它們製造了堆積如山的垃圾,而這些垃圾常常最後流入大海。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to the Ocean 海洋威脅","lab":"A167","t":"免洗"},{"w":"fishery","pos":"n.","def":"an area or business where fish are caught","cn":"漁場;漁業","s":"The local ________ closed for three months, so fish numbers could recover after years of heavy fishing.","zh":"當地漁場關閉三個月,好讓魚群數量在多年的大量捕撈後得以恢復。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A168","t":"漁場"},{"w":"fisherman","pos":"n.","def":"a person who catches fish as a job","cn":"漁夫;漁民","s":"My grandfather was a ________ for forty years, and he says there were far more fish in the sea when he was young.","zh":"我爺爺當了四十年的漁夫,而他說他年輕時海裡的魚多得多。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A169","t":"漁夫"},{"w":"trawler","pos":"n.","def":"a large fishing boat that pulls a big net","cn":"拖網漁船","s":"A huge ________ can catch tons of fish in one day, but it also catches many animals that nobody wants to eat.","zh":"一艘巨大的拖網漁船一天就能捕到好幾噸的魚,但它也捕到許多沒人想吃的動物。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A170","t":"拖網漁船"},{"w":"trawl","pos":"v.","def":"to catch fish by pulling a large net through the water","cn":"拖網捕魚","s":"Boats that ________ along the sea floor damage coral and sponges, so some countries have banned this method.","zh":"沿著海床拖網捕魚的船隻會破壞珊瑚和海綿,所以一些國家已經禁止這種方法。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A171","t":"拖網捕魚"},{"w":"longline","pos":"n.","def":"a very long fishing line with thousands of hooks","cn":"延繩釣","s":"A single ________ can stretch for many kilometres, and sea turtles and birds are sometimes caught on its hooks.","zh":"一條延繩釣可以延伸好幾公里,而且海龜和海鳥有時會被它的鉤子鉤住。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A172","t":"延繩釣"},{"w":"catch / caught / caught","pos":"v.","def":"to get hold of a fish or animal","cn":"捕捉;抓到","s":"My father ________ three large fish yesterday, but he let the smallest one go because it was too young.","zh":"我爸爸昨天捕到三條大魚,但他把最小的那條放走了,因為牠太小了。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A173","t":"捕到"},{"w":"fish stock","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the amount of fish of one kind in an area","cn":"魚類資源;魚群存量","s":"The ______ ______ of tuna has fallen sharply, so the government has limited how many fish each boat can catch.","zh":"鮪魚的魚群存量已經大幅下降,所以政府限制了每艘船能捕撈的魚量。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A174","t":"魚群存量"},{"w":"aquaculture","pos":"n.","def":"the farming of fish and other sea creatures","cn":"水產養殖","s":"________ provides about half of the seafood we eat today, but badly run farms can pollute the water nearby.","zh":"水產養殖提供了我們今天所吃海鮮的大約一半,但管理不善的養殖場會污染附近的水域。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A175","t":"水產養殖"},{"w":"fish farm","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a place where fish are raised for food","cn":"養魚場","s":"The ______ ______ near our village raises milkfish, and it sells them to restaurants all over southern Taiwan.","zh":"我們村子附近的養魚場養殖虱目魚,而且把牠們賣給台灣南部各地的餐廳。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A176","t":"養魚場"},{"w":"seafood","pos":"n.","def":"fish and shellfish eaten as food","cn":"海鮮","s":"We had fresh ________ at the night market, and my brother tried grilled squid for the first time.","zh":"我們在夜市吃了新鮮的海鮮,而我弟弟第一次嚐試了烤魷魚。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A177","t":"海鮮"},{"w":"tuna","pos":"n.","def":"a large sea fish often eaten in sushi or from cans","cn":"鮪魚","s":"Bluefin ________ is very popular in sushi restaurants, but its numbers dropped sharply because of overfishing.","zh":"黑鮪魚在壽司店非常受歡迎,但牠的數量因為過度捕撈而大幅減少。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A178","t":"魚"},{"w":"salmon","pos":"n.","def":"a fish with pink flesh that swims from the sea up rivers to lay eggs","cn":"鮭魚","s":"Every autumn, ________ swim up rivers to lay their eggs, and bears wait by the water to catch them.","zh":"每年秋天,鮭魚會逆流而上產卵,而熊會在水邊等著抓牠們。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A179","t":"鮭魚"},{"w":"shrimp","pos":"n.","def":"a small sea animal with a shell that people eat","cn":"蝦子","s":"Mangroves are often cut down to build ________ farms, so coastlines lose their natural protection from storms.","zh":"紅樹林常被砍伐來興建蝦場,所以海岸線失去了抵擋暴風的天然屏障。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A180","t":"蝦"},{"w":"port","pos":"n.","def":"a town or city with a harbour where ships load and unload","cn":"港口;港市","s":"Kaohsiung is a busy ________, and huge ships arrive there every day from all over the world.","zh":"高雄是個繁忙的港口,而巨大的船隻每天從世界各地抵達那裡。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A181","t":"港口"},{"w":"cargo","pos":"n.","def":"goods carried by a ship, plane or truck","cn":"貨物","s":"The ship was carrying ________ from China to Europe, but a storm forced it to stop in Singapore.","zh":"這艘船正把貨物從中國運往歐洲,但一場暴風雨迫使它停靠新加坡。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A182","t":"貨物"},{"w":"container ship","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a large ship that carries goods in big metal boxes","cn":"貨櫃船","s":"A ______ ______ got stuck in the Suez Canal in 2021, and hundreds of other ships had to wait for days.","zh":"2021年一艘貨櫃船卡在蘇伊士運河,而數百艘其他船隻必須等好幾天。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A183","t":"貨櫃船"},{"w":"tanker","pos":"n.","def":"a ship that carries oil or other liquids","cn":"油輪","s":"The oil ________ ran into rocks near the coast, so thousands of tonnes of oil leaked into the sea.","zh":"那艘油輪在海岸附近撞上岩石,所以數千噸的石油漏入海中。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A184","t":"油輪"},{"w":"freight","pos":"n.","def":"goods carried by ship, train or plane","cn":"貨運;貨物","s":"Most international ________ travels by sea because it is cheaper, although air transport is much faster.","zh":"大部分國際貨運走海運,因為比較便宜,雖然空運快得多。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A185","t":"貨運"},{"w":"shipping lane","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a regular route used by ships at sea","cn":"航道","s":"The ______ ______ passes close to a whale feeding area, so ships are asked to slow down during certain months.","zh":"這條航道靠近鯨魚的覓食區,所以船隻在某些月份被要求減速。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A186","t":"航道"},{"w":"oil rig","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a large structure used to get oil from under the sea","cn":"鑽油平台","s":"Workers on the ______ ______ live at sea for weeks at a time, and they fly home by helicopter.","zh":"鑽油平台上的工人一次在海上住好幾週,而且他們搭直升機回家。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A187","t":"鑽油平台"},{"w":"drilling","pos":"n.","def":"making deep holes in the ground to find oil or gas","cn":"鑽探","s":"Offshore ________ brings money to the region, but many residents worry about another oil spill.","zh":"離岸鑽探為地區帶來收入,但許多居民擔心再次發生漏油。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A188","t":"鑽探"},{"w":"mineral","pos":"n.","def":"a natural substance such as metal found in rock","cn":"礦物","s":"The sea floor contains many valuable ________, but mining them could destroy habitats that we barely understand.","zh":"海床含有許多珍貴的礦物,但開採它們可能會破壞我們幾乎不了解的棲地。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A189","t":"礦物"},{"w":"nodule","pos":"n.","def":"a small round lump of mineral found on the sea floor","cn":"結核(礦物團塊)","s":"Each metal ________ on the sea floor took millions of years to form, so mining companies cannot simply wait for more.","zh":"海床上的每一顆金屬結核都花了數百萬年才形成,所以採礦公司無法單純等它再長出來。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A190","t":"結核"},{"w":"wave power","pos":"n.phr.","def":"electricity made from the movement of sea waves","cn":"波浪發電","s":"Taiwan is surrounded by the sea, so ______ ______ could become an important source of clean energy in the future.","zh":"台灣四面環海,所以波浪發電未來可能成為重要的乾淨能源來源。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A191","t":"波浪發電"},{"w":"fishing ground","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an area of sea where many fish are caught","cn":"漁場","s":"The waters near Penghu are a rich ______ ______, and fishermen there have caught squid for generations.","zh":"澎湖附近的海域是豐富的漁場,那裡的漁民世世代代都在捕魷魚。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A192","t":"漁場"},{"w":"whaling","pos":"n.","def":"the hunting of whales","cn":"捕鯨","s":"Most countries have banned ________, but a few still hunt whales and say it is part of their culture.","zh":"大多數國家已經禁止捕鯨,但少數國家仍然獵捕鯨魚,並說這是他們文化的一部分。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A193","t":"捕鯨"},{"w":"harpoon","pos":"n.","def":"a long spear used to hunt whales and large fish","cn":"魚叉","s":"In the past, hunters threw a ________ by hand, but modern whaling ships use guns that fire them.","zh":"過去,獵人用手投擲魚叉,但現代捕鯨船使用發射魚叉的槍。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A194","t":"魚叉"},{"w":"bait","pos":"n.","def":"food put on a hook or in a trap to catch fish or animals","cn":"魚餌;誘餌","s":"We used small pieces of squid as ________, and within ten minutes my sister caught her first fish.","zh":"我們用小塊魷魚當魚餌,不到十分鐘我妹妹就釣到她的第一條魚。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A195","t":"魚餌"},{"w":"overexploit","pos":"v.","def":"to use too much of a natural resource so it cannot recover","cn":"過度開發;過度利用","s":"If we continue to ________ the sea, there may be almost no large fish left by the end of this century.","zh":"如果我們繼續過度利用海洋,到本世紀末可能幾乎不剩任何大型魚類。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A196","t":"過度利用"},{"w":"pearl","pos":"n.","def":"a small, shiny white ball that grows inside an oyster","cn":"珍珠","s":"Each ________ takes years to grow inside an oyster, so natural ones are rare and very expensive.","zh":"每一顆珍珠都要在牡蠣裡花好幾年才能長成,所以天然珍珠很稀少且非常昂貴。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A197","t":"珍珠"},{"w":"coastguard","pos":"n.","def":"the organisation that protects people and controls activity along the coast","cn":"海巡;海岸巡防隊","s":"The ________ rescued five fishermen after their boat sank, and they also arrested a ship that was fishing illegally.","zh":"海巡在漁船沉沒後救起五名漁民,而且他們也逮捕了一艘非法捕魚的船。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A198","t":"海巡"},{"w":"fleet","pos":"n.","def":"a group of ships that work together","cn":"船隊","s":"The country's fishing ________ has grown to over 2,000 boats, so experts worry that fish cannot reproduce fast enough.","zh":"該國的捕魚船隊已經成長到超過兩千艘船,所以專家擔心魚類繁殖的速度跟不上。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A199","t":"船隊"},{"w":"fishing net","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a net used for catching fish","cn":"漁網","s":"An old ______ ______ was stuck on the reef, and the divers spent an hour cutting it free.","zh":"一張舊漁網卡在珊瑚礁上,潛水員們花了一個小時把它割下來。","part":"A","sec":"Fishing, Shipping & Ocean Resources 漁業、航運與海洋資源","lab":"A200","t":"漁網"},{"w":"abundance","pos":"n.","def":"a very large amount of something","cn":"豐富;大量","s":"There is an ________ of fish around the protected reef, so local divers earn more money from tourists than before.","zh":"受保護的珊瑚礁周圍有大量的魚,所以當地潛水員從遊客身上賺的錢比以前多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B1","t":"大量"},{"w":"adhere","pos":"v.","def":"to follow a rule or agreement closely","cn":"遵守;堅持","s":"All boats must ________ to the new speed limits in the bay, or they will have to pay a heavy fine.","zh":"所有船隻都必須遵守海灣新的速限,否則將被處以重罰。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B2","t":"遵守"},{"w":"advent","pos":"n.","def":"the arrival or beginning of something important","cn":"出現;到來","s":"Since the ________ of cheap plastic in the 1950s, the amount of rubbish in the ocean has grown every year.","zh":"自從1950年代廉價塑膠出現以來,海洋中的垃圾量每年都在增加。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B3","t":"出現"},{"w":"ample","pos":"adj.","def":"more than enough","cn":"充足的;大量的","s":"The research ship carries ________ food and fuel for two months, so the scientists do not need to return to port often.","zh":"研究船載有足夠兩個月的充足食物和燃料,所以科學家不需要常常返港。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B4","t":"充足"},{"w":"analogous","pos":"adj.","def":"similar in some way","cn":"類似的","s":"A coral reef is ________ to a busy city, because thousands of different creatures live and work closely together.","zh":"珊瑚礁類似一座繁忙的城市,因為成千上萬種不同的生物緊密地一起生活和運作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B5","t":"類似"},{"w":"apparatus","pos":"n.","def":"equipment used for a particular purpose","cn":"儀器;設備","s":"Divers must check their breathing ________ carefully, because one broken part could put their lives in danger.","zh":"潛水員必須仔細檢查他們的呼吸設備,因為一個損壞的零件就可能危及生命。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B6","t":"設備"},{"w":"appreciable","pos":"adj.","def":"large enough to be noticed","cn":"可觀的;明顯的","s":"The ban on plastic bags led to an ________ drop in beach litter, and volunteers noticed the change within a year.","zh":"塑膠袋禁令讓海灘垃圾明顯減少,而志工在一年內就注意到這個改變。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B7","t":"明顯"},{"w":"audit","pos":"n.","def":"an official check of records or activities","cn":"稽核;審查","s":"The government carried out an ________ of all fishing boats, and it found that some were catching more than allowed.","zh":"政府對所有漁船進行稽核,並發現有些船的捕撈量超過規定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B8","t":"稽核"},{"w":"autonomy","pos":"n.","def":"the freedom to make your own decisions","cn":"自主權","s":"Local fishing villages want more ________ over their waters, because they understand the sea better than officials in the city.","zh":"當地漁村希望對自己的水域有更多自主權,因為他們比城市裡的官員更了解大海。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B9","t":"自主權"},{"w":"cater","pos":"v.","def":"to provide what people need or want","cn":"迎合;滿足需求","s":"The aquarium has special tours that ________ to young children, so families with toddlers can enjoy the visit too.","zh":"水族館有專門迎合幼童的導覽,所以有幼兒的家庭也能享受參觀。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B10","t":"迎合"},{"w":"compel","pos":"v.","def":"to force someone to do something","cn":"迫使;強迫","s":"Rising fuel prices ________ many fishermen to stay in port, so fresh seafood became more expensive at the market.","zh":"上漲的油價迫使許多漁民留在港內,所以市場上的新鮮海鮮變得更貴。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B11","t":"迫使"},{"w":"conducive","pos":"adj.","def":"helping something to happen","cn":"有助於……的","s":"Warm, clear water is ________ to coral growth, but water that is too hot can kill the reef.","zh":"溫暖清澈的海水有助於珊瑚生長,但太熱的海水會殺死珊瑚礁。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B12","t":"有助於"},{"w":"confer","pos":"v.","def":"to discuss something with others before deciding","cn":"商議;協商","s":"The ship's captain had to ________ with the coastguard before he changed course, because the weather was getting worse.","zh":"船長在改變航向前必須與海巡商議,因為天氣越來越糟。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B13","t":"商議"},{"w":"configuration","pos":"n.","def":"the way parts are arranged","cn":"配置;結構","s":"The ________ of the new offshore wind farm was changed, so the turbines would not block the whales' route.","zh":"新離岸風場的配置被修改了,這樣風機就不會擋住鯨魚的路線。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B14","t":"配置"},{"w":"consecutive","pos":"adj.","def":"following one after another without a break","cn":"連續的","s":"The reef has suffered from very hot water for three ________ summers, so scientists fear it may not recover.","zh":"這片珊瑚礁已經連續三個夏天受到極熱海水的影響,所以科學家擔心它可能無法恢復。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B15","t":"連續"},{"w":"constituent","pos":"n.","def":"one of the parts that form something","cn":"成分;組成部分","s":"Salt is the main ________ that makes sea water different from river water, but it also contains many other minerals.","zh":"鹽是讓海水與河水不同的主要成分,但海水也含有許多其他礦物質。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B16","t":"成分"},{"w":"contemplate","pos":"v.","def":"to think carefully about something","cn":"考慮;沉思","s":"The town is ________ a ban on jet skis near the beach, because the noise disturbs both swimmers and dolphins.","zh":"鎮上正在考慮禁止在海灘附近使用水上摩托車,因為噪音會干擾泳客和海豚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B17","t":"考慮"},{"w":"contingent","pos":"adj.","def":"depending on something else","cn":"取決於……的","s":"Our boat trip is ________ on the weather, so we will check the forecast tomorrow morning before we decide.","zh":"我們的乘船行程取決於天氣,所以我們明天早上決定前會先看天氣預報。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B18","t":"取決於"},{"w":"convene","pos":"v.","def":"to come together for a formal meeting","cn":"召開;召集","s":"World leaders will ________ in New York next month, and they hope to sign a treaty to protect the high seas.","zh":"世界領袖下個月將在紐約召開會議,而他們希望簽署一項保護公海的條約。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B19","t":"召開會議"},{"w":"curtail","pos":"v.","def":"to reduce or limit something","cn":"削減;限制","s":"The government decided to ________ fishing during the spawning season, so the fish could lay their eggs safely.","zh":"政府決定在產卵季節限制捕魚,讓魚能安全地產卵。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B20","t":"限制"},{"w":"dedicate","pos":"v.","def":"to give your time and energy to something","cn":"奉獻;致力於","s":"She has ________ her life to protecting sea turtles, and she spends every summer guarding their nests at night.","zh":"她把一生奉獻給保護海龜,而且她每年夏天晚上都在守護牠們的巢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B21","t":"奉獻"},{"w":"deliberate","pos":"adj.","def":"done on purpose","cn":"故意的;蓄意的","s":"The oil spill was not an accident but a ________ act, so the ship's owner was taken to court.","zh":"這起漏油不是意外而是蓄意的行為,所以船主被告上法院。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B22","t":"蓄意的"},{"w":"delineate","pos":"v.","def":"to describe or mark the exact edges of something","cn":"劃定;描繪","s":"The new map clearly ________ the borders of the marine park, so fishermen know exactly where they cannot fish.","zh":"新地圖清楚劃定了海洋公園的邊界,所以漁民確切知道哪裡不能捕魚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B23","t":"劃定"},{"w":"denote","pos":"v.","def":"to be a sign of something","cn":"表示;代表","s":"Red flags on the beach ________ dangerous currents, so swimmers should stay out of the water when they see them.","zh":"海灘上的紅旗表示有危險的海流,所以泳客看到時應該遠離水域。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B24","t":"表示"},{"w":"designate","pos":"v.","def":"to officially choose something for a purpose","cn":"指定;劃定","s":"The government plans to ________ the bay as a protected area, and fishing there will be banned from next year.","zh":"政府計畫把這個海灣劃定為保護區,而且明年起將禁止在那裡捕魚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B25","t":"劃定"},{"w":"devise","pos":"v.","def":"to plan or invent a new way of doing something","cn":"設計;想出","s":"Students ________ a simple machine that collects floating plastic, and they tested it in the river near their school.","zh":"學生們設計了一台收集漂浮塑膠的簡單機器,而且在學校附近的河裡進行測試。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B26","t":"設計"},{"w":"disperse","pos":"v.","def":"to spread over a wide area","cn":"分散;擴散","s":"Strong winds helped ________ the oil across a large area, so the clean-up became much more difficult.","zh":"強風讓油污擴散到大片區域,所以清理工作變得困難許多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B27","t":"擴散"},{"w":"disrupt","pos":"v.","def":"to stop something from continuing normally","cn":"擾亂;破壞","s":"Loud ship noise can ________ the way whales communicate, so they may lose contact with their family groups.","zh":"巨大的船隻噪音會擾亂鯨魚的溝通方式,所以牠們可能和家族群體失去聯繫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B28","t":"擾亂"},{"w":"dissipate","pos":"v.","def":"to slowly disappear or become weaker","cn":"消散;消失","s":"The typhoon began to ________ after it reached land, but heavy rain continued for two more days.","zh":"颱風登陸後開始減弱消散,但大雨又持續了兩天。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B29","t":"減弱消散"},{"w":"diverge","pos":"v.","def":"to go in different directions","cn":"分歧;分開","s":"Scientists' opinions ________ on deep-sea mining, because some focus on the metals while others focus on the damage.","zh":"科學家們對深海採礦的看法分歧,因為有些人著重在金屬,而有些人著重在破壞。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B30","t":"分歧"},{"w":"divert","pos":"v.","def":"to change the direction of something","cn":"使改道;轉移","s":"The ship was ________ to a different port because of the storm, so the passengers arrived a day late.","zh":"這艘船因為暴風雨被改道到另一個港口,所以乘客晚了一天抵達。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B31","t":"改道"},{"w":"durable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to last a long time without breaking","cn":"耐用的","s":"Fishing nets are made of ________ plastic, so they can stay in the ocean for hundreds of years after they are lost.","zh":"漁網是用耐用的塑膠製成的,所以遺失後它們能在海洋中留存數百年。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B32","t":"耐用的"},{"w":"elicit","pos":"v.","def":"to get a reaction or information from someone","cn":"引出;引起","s":"The photo of a turtle with a straw in its nose ________ a strong reaction online, and many people stopped using straws.","zh":"一張海龜鼻子插著吸管的照片在網路上引起強烈反應,而許多人因此不再使用吸管。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B33","t":"引起"},{"w":"elusive","pos":"adj.","def":"difficult to find or catch","cn":"難以捉摸的;難找到的","s":"The giant squid is so ________ that nobody filmed one alive until 2012, although sailors told stories about it for centuries.","zh":"大王魷魚非常難以找到,直到2012年才有人拍到活體,儘管水手們講述牠的故事已經好幾個世紀。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B34","t":"難以找到"},{"w":"embark","pos":"v.","def":"to start something new and important","cn":"開始;著手","s":"The team will ________ on a two-year study of the reef, and they will dive there every month to collect data.","zh":"團隊將著手一項為期兩年的珊瑚礁研究,而且他們每個月都會潛到那裡收集數據。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B35","t":"著手"},{"w":"endeavour","pos":"n.","def":"a serious attempt to do something difficult","cn":"努力;嘗試","s":"Cleaning the whole ocean is a huge ________, but every small action by individuals still makes a difference.","zh":"清理整個海洋是一項巨大的努力,但每個人的小行動仍然能帶來改變。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B36","t":"努力"},{"w":"envisage","pos":"v.","def":"to imagine something as a future possibility","cn":"設想;預見","s":"The mayor ________ a clean harbour where children can swim safely, so she has started a ten-year plan.","zh":"市長設想一個孩子們能安全游泳的乾淨港口,所以她已經啟動了一項十年計畫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B37","t":"設想"},{"w":"exhaustive","pos":"adj.","def":"very complete and including everything","cn":"詳盡的;徹底的","s":"The report gives an ________ list of all the fish species in the bay, and it took researchers five years to finish.","zh":"這份報告列出了海灣內所有魚種的詳盡清單,而研究人員花了五年才完成。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B38","t":"詳盡"},{"w":"formulate","pos":"v.","def":"to develop a plan carefully","cn":"制定;規劃","s":"The council is trying to ________ a plan to reduce plastic waste, and it wants ideas from local students.","zh":"議會正在試著制定減少塑膠垃圾的計畫,而且它希望聽取當地學生的想法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B39","t":"制定"},{"w":"identical","pos":"adj.","def":"exactly the same","cn":"完全相同的","s":"The two fish look almost ________, but one lives only in fresh water while the other lives in the sea.","zh":"這兩種魚看起來幾乎一模一樣,但一種只生活在淡水中,而另一種生活在海裡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B40","t":"一模一樣"},{"w":"immense","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely large","cn":"巨大的;龐大的","s":"The ocean holds an ________ amount of heat, so it has slowed down global warming on land.","zh":"海洋儲存了巨大的熱量,所以它減緩了陸地上的全球暖化。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B41","t":"巨大的"},{"w":"imperative","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely important and needing urgent action","cn":"迫切的;必要的","s":"It is ________ that we protect the remaining mangroves, because they defend the coast and store large amounts of carbon.","zh":"保護剩下的紅樹林是刻不容緩的,因為它們保護海岸並儲存大量的碳。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B42","t":"刻不容緩的"},{"w":"inclination","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling that makes you want to do something","cn":"傾向;意願","s":"Many young people have little ________ to become fishermen, so the average age of fishermen keeps rising.","zh":"許多年輕人沒什麼意願成為漁民,所以漁民的平均年齡持續上升。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B43","t":"意願"},{"w":"intricate","pos":"adj.","def":"having many small parts or details","cn":"錯綜複雜的;精細的","s":"The ________ shapes of coral provide hiding places for small fish, so a healthy reef supports many kinds of life.","zh":"珊瑚錯綜複雜的形狀為小魚提供藏身處,所以健康的珊瑚礁能支持許多種生命。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B44","t":"錯綜複雜的"},{"w":"invaluable","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely useful","cn":"非常寶貴的","s":"Local fishermen gave ________ help to the scientists, because they knew exactly where the rare fish could be found.","zh":"當地漁民給了科學家非常寶貴的幫助,因為他們確切知道哪裡能找到稀有的魚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B45","t":"非常寶貴的"},{"w":"inventory","pos":"n.","def":"a complete list of things in a place","cn":"清單;盤點","s":"Divers made an ________ of every coral species on the reef, so they could see changes in the following years.","zh":"潛水員為珊瑚礁上的每一種珊瑚做了清單,這樣他們就能看到接下來幾年的變化。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B46","t":"清單"},{"w":"legitimate","pos":"adj.","def":"fair, reasonable or legal","cn":"合理的;合法的","s":"Fishermen have ________ concerns about the new rules, because their families depend on fishing for income.","zh":"漁民對新規定有合理的擔憂,因為他們的家庭依靠捕魚維生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B47","t":"合理的"},{"w":"numerous","pos":"adj.","def":"many","cn":"許多的;眾多的","s":"The beach clean-up found ________ bottle caps and lighters, and many of them had come from other countries.","zh":"淨灘活動發現了許多瓶蓋和打火機,而它們有很多來自其他國家。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B48","t":"許多"},{"w":"omit","pos":"v.","def":"to leave out something","cn":"省略;遺漏","s":"The company ________ important facts about the oil leak in its report, so the public did not trust its explanation.","zh":"公司在報告中遺漏了漏油的重要事實,所以大眾不相信它的解釋。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B49","t":"遺漏"},{"w":"optimal","pos":"adj.","def":"best or most suitable","cn":"最佳的","s":"Early morning is the ________ time for diving here, because the water is calm and the light is soft.","zh":"清晨是這裡潛水的最佳時間,因為海水平靜而且光線柔和。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B50","t":"最佳"},{"w":"orient","pos":"v.","def":"to find your position or direction","cn":"定向;確定方位","s":"Sea turtles use the Earth's magnetic field to ________ themselves, so they can return to the beach where they were born.","zh":"海龜利用地球的磁場來定向,所以牠們能回到出生的海灘。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B51","t":"定向"},{"w":"pertinent","pos":"adj.","def":"directly connected to the subject","cn":"相關的;切題的","s":"The student asked a ________ question about plastic in seafood, and the expert was happy to explain the latest research.","zh":"那位學生問了一個關於海鮮中塑膠的切題問題,而專家很樂意解釋最新的研究。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B52","t":"切題"},{"w":"practitioner","pos":"n.","def":"a person who works in a skilled job","cn":"從業人員;實踐者","s":"Every diving ________ must complete safety training, because guiding tourists underwater is a serious responsibility.","zh":"每位潛水從業人員都必須完成安全訓練,因為在水下帶領遊客是一項重大的責任。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B53","t":"從業人員"},{"w":"prone","pos":"adj.","def":"likely to suffer from something","cn":"易於……的","s":"This part of the coast is ________ to strong currents, so swimming is not allowed without a lifeguard.","zh":"這段海岸容易出現強勁的海流,所以沒有救生員時禁止游泳。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B54","t":"容易"},{"w":"provoke","pos":"v.","def":"to cause a strong reaction","cn":"引起;激起","s":"The plan to build a factory near the reef ________ angry protests, and thousands of people signed a petition against it.","zh":"在珊瑚礁附近興建工廠的計畫引起憤怒的抗議,而且數千人連署反對。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B55","t":"引起"},{"w":"proximity","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being near","cn":"鄰近;接近","s":"Because of its ________ to the sea, the town has fresh seafood, but it also faces greater danger from typhoons.","zh":"由於鄰近大海,這個小鎮有新鮮的海鮮,但它也面臨更大的颱風威脅。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B56","t":"鄰近"},{"w":"readily","pos":"adv.","def":"quickly and easily","cn":"容易地;迅速地","s":"Plastic bags are ________ available in many shops, so people use them without thinking about where they end up.","zh":"塑膠袋在許多商店都很容易取得,所以人們使用時不會去想它們最後的去處。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B57","t":"很容易"},{"w":"recede","pos":"v.","def":"to move back from a higher point","cn":"退去;後退","s":"After the storm, the water began to ________, and people returned to clean the mud from their homes.","zh":"暴風雨過後,海水開始退去,人們回去清理家中的泥巴。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B58","t":"退去"},{"w":"reciprocal","pos":"adj.","def":"given or done in return by both sides","cn":"互惠的;相互的","s":"The two countries signed a ________ agreement, so each one can fish in the other's waters under strict rules.","zh":"兩國簽訂了一項互惠協議,所以雙方都能在嚴格規定下在對方水域捕魚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B59","t":"互惠"},{"w":"regenerate","pos":"v.","def":"to grow again after damage","cn":"再生;重新生長","s":"A starfish can ________ a lost arm, but it takes several months for the new arm to grow fully.","zh":"海星能再生失去的觸腕,但新的觸腕要好幾個月才能完全長好。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B60","t":"再生"},{"w":"render","pos":"v.","def":"to cause something to be in a certain condition","cn":"使成為;使變得","s":"The oil spill ________ the beach unsafe for months, so many hotels lost most of their summer guests.","zh":"漏油使海灘好幾個月都不安全,所以許多飯店失去了大部分夏季客人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B61","t":"使"},{"w":"replenish","pos":"v.","def":"to fill something up again","cn":"補充;使恢復","s":"Fish need time to ________ their numbers, so the fishing season is closed for three months every year.","zh":"魚類需要時間來恢復數量,所以每年漁季會關閉三個月。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B62","t":"恢復"},{"w":"reproduce","pos":"v.","def":"to produce young animals or plants","cn":"繁殖","s":"Many sharks ________ slowly and have only a few babies, so their numbers fall quickly when too many are caught.","zh":"許多鯊魚繁殖緩慢,而且只生幾隻寶寶,所以捕撈太多時牠們的數量會快速下降。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B63","t":"繁殖"},{"w":"restrain","pos":"v.","def":"to stop someone from doing something","cn":"抑制;克制","s":"Parents should ________ their children from touching coral, because even a gentle touch can damage the living animals.","zh":"父母應該制止孩子觸摸珊瑚,因為即使輕輕一碰也可能傷害這些活的生物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B64","t":"制止"},{"w":"segment","pos":"n.","def":"one part of something","cn":"部分;區段","s":"Only one ________ of the coast is open to tourists, while the rest is protected for nesting birds.","zh":"海岸只有一個區段開放給遊客,而其餘部分是為了築巢的鳥類而受到保護。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B65","t":"區段"},{"w":"sparse","pos":"adj.","def":"small in number and spread out","cn":"稀疏的;稀少的","s":"Fish are ________ in the open ocean far from land, but they gather in large numbers near reefs and coasts.","zh":"遠離陸地的大洋中魚類稀少,但牠們會大量聚集在珊瑚礁和海岸附近。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B66","t":"稀少"},{"w":"subtle","pos":"adj.","def":"small and not easy to notice","cn":"細微的;微妙的","s":"The changes in the reef were ________ at first, but after five years most of the colourful coral had disappeared.","zh":"珊瑚礁的變化起初很細微,但五年後大部分色彩繽紛的珊瑚都消失了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B67","t":"細微"},{"w":"surplus","pos":"n.","def":"an amount that is more than needed","cn":"過剩;剩餘","s":"The fish farm produced a ________ this year, so the owner gave extra fish to a local food bank.","zh":"今年養魚場的產量過剩,所以老闆把多出來的魚送給當地的食物銀行。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B68","t":"過剩"},{"w":"abrupt","pos":"adj.","def":"sudden and unexpected","cn":"突然的","s":"There was an ________ drop in water temperature, and many tropical fish died because they could not adjust in time.","zh":"水溫突然下降,許多熱帶魚因為無法及時適應而死亡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B69","t":"突然"},{"w":"aesthetic","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with beauty","cn":"美學的;審美的","s":"The coastline has great ________ value, so people are against building a large factory that would spoil the view.","zh":"這條海岸線有極高的美學價值,所以人們反對興建會破壞景觀的大型工廠。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B70","t":"美學"},{"w":"align","pos":"v.","def":"to arrange things so they agree or match","cn":"使一致;使對齊","s":"The new fishing rules ________ with international law, so Taiwanese boats can continue to sell fish to Europe.","zh":"新的漁業規定與國際法一致,所以台灣的船隻能繼續把魚賣到歐洲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B71","t":"一致"},{"w":"aspire","pos":"v.","def":"to have a strong wish to achieve something","cn":"渴望;立志","s":"Many students ________ to work in marine science, but they need strong maths and biology skills first.","zh":"許多學生立志從事海洋科學工作,但他們首先需要很好的數學和生物能力。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B72","t":"立志"},{"w":"assure","pos":"v.","def":"to tell someone confidently that something is true","cn":"向……保證","s":"The captain ________ the passengers that the storm would pass soon, and he asked them to stay inside.","zh":"船長向乘客保證暴風雨很快就會過去,並請他們待在室內。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B73","t":"向乘客保證"},{"w":"authentic","pos":"adj.","def":"real and not a copy","cn":"真正的;道地的","s":"The restaurant serves ________ fishermen's dishes, and the owner buys fresh fish from the harbour every morning.","zh":"這家餐廳供應道地的漁家料理,而老闆每天早上都從港口買新鮮的魚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B74","t":"道地的"},{"w":"circumvent","pos":"v.","def":"to find a way around a rule or problem","cn":"規避;繞過","s":"Some fishing boats ________ the rules by changing their flags, so it is hard for officials to track them.","zh":"有些漁船藉由更換船旗來規避規定,所以官員很難追蹤它們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B75","t":"規避"},{"w":"culminate","pos":"v.","def":"to end with an important event","cn":"以……告終;達到頂點","s":"Years of protests ________ in a new law that banned plastic bags, and many people saw it as a great victory.","zh":"多年的抗議最終促成一項禁用塑膠袋的新法律,而許多人把它視為一大勝利。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B76","t":"促成"},{"w":"decisive","pos":"adj.","def":"having a very important effect on the result","cn":"決定性的","s":"Quick action by the coastguard played a ________ role, because the oil was stopped before it reached the beach.","zh":"海巡的迅速行動發揮了決定性的作用,因為油污在抵達海灘前就被攔住了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B77","t":"決定性的"},{"w":"disclose","pos":"v.","def":"to make information known to the public","cn":"揭露;公開","s":"The company refused to ________ how much waste it had dumped into the sea, so journalists began their own investigation.","zh":"公司拒絕公開它把多少廢棄物傾倒入海,所以記者們開始自行調查。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B78","t":"公開"},{"w":"empower","pos":"v.","def":"to give someone the power or confidence to do something","cn":"賦予……權力;使有能力","s":"The project ________ local villagers to manage their own fishing areas, and fish numbers have since increased.","zh":"這個計畫賦予當地村民管理自己漁區的權力,而魚群數量從那時起就增加了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B79","t":"賦予"},{"w":"equip","pos":"v.","def":"to provide the tools needed for a job","cn":"配備;裝備","s":"The new research boat is ________ with modern sonar, so scientists can map the sea floor in great detail.","zh":"新的研究船配備有現代聲納,所以科學家能非常詳細地繪製海床地圖。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B80","t":"配備"},{"w":"expertise","pos":"n.","def":"special skill or knowledge","cn":"專業知識;專長","s":"The team needed someone with ________ in underwater filming, so they hired a famous wildlife cameraman.","zh":"團隊需要一位具備水下攝影專業的人,所以他們聘請了一位知名的野生動物攝影師。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B81","t":"專業"},{"w":"incident","pos":"n.","def":"an event, especially an unusual or unpleasant one","cn":"事件;事故","s":"The shark ________ frightened many tourists, but experts reminded everyone that attacks are extremely rare.","zh":"這起鯊魚事件嚇壞了許多遊客,但專家提醒大家攻擊事件極為罕見。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B82","t":"事件"},{"w":"insert","pos":"v.","def":"to put something inside something else","cn":"插入;放入","s":"Scientists ________ a tiny tracker under the turtle's shell, and now they can follow its journey across the ocean.","zh":"科學家在海龜的殼下放入一個微小的追蹤器,現在他們能追蹤牠橫越海洋的旅程。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B83","t":"放入"},{"w":"instruct","pos":"v.","def":"to tell someone officially what to do","cn":"指示;教導","s":"The guide ________ us not to touch anything underwater, because some sea creatures can sting or bite.","zh":"導遊指示我們不要碰水下的任何東西,因為有些海洋生物會螫人或咬人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B84","t":"指示"},{"w":"medium","pos":"n.","def":"a way of communicating or expressing something","cn":"媒介;媒體","s":"Film is a powerful ________ for teaching people about the ocean, because many viewers have never seen a coral reef.","zh":"影片是教導人們認識海洋的強大媒介,因為許多觀眾從未見過珊瑚礁。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B85","t":"媒介"},{"w":"mode","pos":"n.","def":"a particular way of doing something","cn":"方式;模式","s":"Shipping is the cheapest ________ of transport for heavy goods, but it also produces a lot of pollution.","zh":"海運是運送重物最便宜的運輸方式,但它也產生大量污染。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B86","t":"方式"},{"w":"panel","pos":"n.","def":"a group of experts who discuss or decide something","cn":"小組;委員會","s":"A ________ of scientists will review the mining plan, and their report will be shared with the public next month.","zh":"一個科學家小組將審查採礦計畫,而他們的報告下個月會公開。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B87","t":"小組"},{"w":"prime","pos":"adj.","def":"main or most important","cn":"主要的;首要的","s":"Overfishing is a ________ cause of the decline in shark numbers, but climate change also plays a part.","zh":"過度捕撈是鯊魚數量下降的主要原因,但氣候變遷也有影響。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B88","t":"主要"},{"w":"principal","pos":"adj.","def":"most important","cn":"主要的","s":"Tourism is the island's ________ source of income, so a healthy reef is important for every family there.","zh":"觀光業是這座島的主要收入來源,所以健康的珊瑚礁對那裡的每個家庭都很重要。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B89","t":"主要"},{"w":"transit","pos":"n.","def":"the act of moving people or goods from one place to another","cn":"運輸;運送","s":"Some fish die during ________ to the market, so fishermen keep them in cold water on the boat.","zh":"有些魚在運送到市場的途中死亡,所以漁民在船上把牠們養在冷水中。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B90","t":"運送"},{"w":"vision","pos":"n.","def":"an idea or hope about the future","cn":"願景;遠見","s":"The organisation has a ________ of plastic-free oceans by 2050, but it knows the goal will be very hard to reach.","zh":"這個組織有一個在2050年前實現無塑海洋的願景,但它知道這個目標非常難達成。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B91","t":"願景"},{"w":"involve","pos":"v.","def":"to include someone or something as a necessary part","cn":"涉及;使參與","s":"The clean-up project will ________ students from ten schools, and each class will look after one part of the beach.","zh":"淨灘計畫將讓十所學校的學生參與,而每個班級將負責海灘的一部分。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B92","t":"讓十所學校的學生參與"},{"w":"respond","pos":"v.","def":"to react to something","cn":"回應;反應","s":"Corals ________ to heat stress by losing their colour, and they may die if the water does not cool down.","zh":"珊瑚會以失去顏色來回應熱壓力,而且如果海水不降溫,它們可能會死亡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B93","t":"回應"},{"w":"remove","pos":"v.","def":"to take something away","cn":"移除;去除","s":"Divers worked for three days to ________ a huge fishing net, and they freed several trapped turtles.","zh":"潛水員花了三天移除一張巨大的漁網,並解救了幾隻受困的海龜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B94","t":"移除"},{"w":"structure","pos":"n.","def":"something built from many parts","cn":"結構;構造","s":"An old oil platform can become a ________ for marine life, because coral and fish quickly settle on its legs.","zh":"一座舊的鑽油平台可以成為海洋生物的構造物,因為珊瑚和魚很快就會在它的支柱上定居。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B95","t":"構造物"},{"w":"export","pos":"v.","def":"to sell goods to another country","cn":"出口","s":"Taiwan ________ large amounts of frozen fish every year, and much of it goes to Japan and the United States.","zh":"台灣每年出口大量冷凍魚,而其中很多銷往日本和美國。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B96","t":"出口"},{"w":"index","pos":"n.","def":"a number used to measure changes","cn":"指數;指標","s":"The ocean health ________ gives each country a score, so we can compare how well they protect their seas.","zh":"海洋健康指數給每個國家一個分數,所以我們能比較它們保護海洋的成效。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B97","t":"指數"},{"w":"licence","pos":"n.","def":"an official document that allows you to do something","cn":"執照;許可證","s":"You need a fishing ________ to fish in this lake, and the money helps pay for protecting the fish.","zh":"在這座湖釣魚需要釣魚許可證,而這筆錢有助於支付保護魚類的費用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B98","t":"許可證"},{"w":"error","pos":"n.","def":"a mistake","cn":"錯誤","s":"A small ________ in the ship's map led it onto the rocks, so the company now checks all its maps twice.","zh":"船上地圖的一個小錯誤導致它撞上礁石,所以公司現在會把所有地圖檢查兩次。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B99","t":"錯誤"},{"w":"affluent","pos":"adj.","def":"rich and having a comfortable life","cn":"富裕的","s":"________ countries eat far more seafood per person, but poorer coastal communities often depend on fish to survive.","zh":"富裕國家每人吃的海鮮多得多,但較貧窮的沿海社區常常依賴魚類維生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B100","t":"富裕"},{"w":"amenity","pos":"n.","def":"something that makes a place comfortable or easy to use","cn":"便利設施","s":"The new beach park has every ________ visitors need, such as showers and toilets, but it also has strict rules about rubbish.","zh":"新的海灘公園有遊客需要的各種便利設施,例如淋浴間和廁所,但它對垃圾也有嚴格的規定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B101","t":"便利設施"},{"w":"anecdotal","pos":"adj.","def":"based on personal stories, not careful research","cn":"傳聞的;軼事的","s":"Fishermen have ________ evidence that fish are getting smaller, but scientists want more data before they agree.","zh":"漁民有魚越來越小的傳聞證據,但科學家在同意之前想要更多數據。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B102","t":"傳聞"},{"w":"apathy","pos":"n.","def":"a lack of interest or concern","cn":"冷漠;漠不關心","s":"Public ________ about ocean pollution is a big problem, because people rarely see what happens under the waves.","zh":"大眾對海洋污染的冷漠是個大問題,因為人們很少看到海浪下發生的事。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B103","t":"冷漠"},{"w":"arduous","pos":"adj.","def":"very difficult and tiring","cn":"艱鉅的;費力的","s":"Rowing across the Atlantic is an ________ journey, and the young woman spent ninety days alone on the ocean.","zh":"划船橫越大西洋是一段艱辛的旅程,而那位年輕女子獨自在海上度過了九十天。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B104","t":"艱辛的"},{"w":"attest","pos":"v.","def":"to show or prove that something is true","cn":"證明;證實","s":"Local divers can ________ to the reef's recovery, because they have seen the fish return over the past few years.","zh":"當地潛水員能證明珊瑚礁的恢復,因為他們這幾年親眼看到魚群回來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B105","t":"證明"},{"w":"authorise","pos":"v.","def":"to give official permission for something","cn":"授權;批准","s":"Only the government can ________ fishing in the marine park, and boats without permits will be stopped.","zh":"只有政府能批准在海洋公園內捕魚,而沒有許可證的船隻將被攔下。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B106","t":"批准"},{"w":"avert","pos":"v.","def":"to prevent something bad from happening","cn":"避免;防止","s":"Quick action by the crew helped ________ a disaster, because they fixed the leak before the ship began to sink.","zh":"船員的迅速行動幫助避免了一場災難,因為他們在船開始下沉前修好了漏洞。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B107","t":"避免"},{"w":"bleak","pos":"adj.","def":"without hope or encouragement","cn":"黯淡的;無望的","s":"The future of the reef looks ________ if sea temperatures keep rising, but scientists say it is not too late to act.","zh":"如果海水溫度持續上升,珊瑚礁的前景看起來很黯淡,但科學家說現在採取行動還不算太遲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B108","t":"黯淡"},{"w":"breakthrough","pos":"n.","def":"an important new discovery","cn":"突破","s":"Scientists made a ________ in growing coral in labs, so damaged reefs may be repaired faster in the future.","zh":"科學家在實驗室培育珊瑚方面取得了突破,所以受損的珊瑚礁未來可能會更快被修復。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B109","t":"突破"},{"w":"burgeoning","pos":"adj.","def":"growing quickly","cn":"迅速發展的","s":"The island's ________ diving industry has created many jobs, but it also puts more pressure on the reefs.","zh":"這座島迅速發展的潛水產業創造了許多工作機會,但它也對珊瑚礁造成更大的壓力。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B110","t":"迅速發展的"},{"w":"capitalise","pos":"v.","def":"to use a situation to gain an advantage","cn":"利用;從中獲利","s":"The town decided to ________ on its whale-watching tours, and tourism has now replaced fishing as its main business.","zh":"這個小鎮決定利用賞鯨行程,而觀光業現在已經取代捕魚成為它的主要產業。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B111","t":"利用"},{"w":"catalyst","pos":"n.","def":"something that causes an important change","cn":"催化劑;促成因素","s":"The oil spill was a ________ for change, because it made the public demand stricter safety laws for ships.","zh":"這起漏油事件是改變的催化劑,因為它讓大眾要求更嚴格的船舶安全法規。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B112","t":"催化劑"},{"w":"cautious","pos":"adj.","def":"careful to avoid danger","cn":"謹慎的;小心的","s":"New divers should be ________ near strong currents, so they should always stay close to their guide.","zh":"新手潛水員在強勁海流附近應該謹慎,所以他們應該總是待在導遊身邊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B113","t":"謹慎"},{"w":"complacent","pos":"adj.","def":"too satisfied and not worried about possible danger","cn":"自滿的;掉以輕心的","s":"We cannot become ________ after one good year, because fish numbers can fall again very quickly.","zh":"我們不能在一個好年之後就掉以輕心,因為魚群數量可能會很快再次下降。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B114","t":"掉以輕心"},{"w":"concise","pos":"adj.","def":"short and clear","cn":"簡潔的","s":"The guide gave a ________ safety talk before the dive, and everyone understood the rules in just five minutes.","zh":"導遊在潛水前做了一段簡潔的安全說明,而每個人只花五分鐘就了解規則。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B115","t":"簡潔的"},{"w":"condemn","pos":"v.","def":"to say strongly that something is wrong","cn":"譴責","s":"Environmental groups ________ the plan to dump waste at sea, and they asked the government to stop it immediately.","zh":"環保團體譴責在海上傾倒廢棄物的計畫,並要求政府立即停止。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B116","t":"譴責"},{"w":"conscientious","pos":"adj.","def":"careful to do things well and correctly","cn":"認真的;盡責的","s":"She is a ________ diver who always picks up rubbish underwater, so her friends call her the reef's guardian.","zh":"她是一位盡責的潛水員,總是在水下撿垃圾,所以朋友們稱她為珊瑚礁守護者。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B117","t":"盡責的"},{"w":"counterpart","pos":"n.","def":"a person or thing with the same role in a different place","cn":"對應的人或物;同行","s":"Taiwan's coastguard met its Japanese ________ to discuss illegal fishing, and they agreed to share information.","zh":"台灣海巡與日本的對口單位會面討論非法捕魚,而且雙方同意分享資訊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B118","t":"對口單位"},{"w":"cynical","pos":"adj.","def":"believing people only act for their own benefit","cn":"憤世嫉俗的;懷疑的","s":"Some people are ________ about the company's green promises, because it still sells huge amounts of plastic.","zh":"有些人對這家公司的環保承諾抱持懷疑的態度,因為它仍然販售大量塑膠。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B119","t":"懷疑的"},{"w":"daunting","pos":"adj.","def":"making you feel worried about whether you can succeed","cn":"令人卻步的","s":"Cleaning the whole coastline seemed ________ at first, but hundreds of volunteers finished the job in one weekend.","zh":"清理整條海岸線起初看起來令人卻步,但數百名志工在一個週末就完成了工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B120","t":"令人卻步"},{"w":"dearth","pos":"n.","def":"a lack of something","cn":"缺乏;不足","s":"There is a ________ of data about the deep sea, so scientists cannot predict how mining will affect it.","zh":"關於深海的數據缺乏,所以科學家無法預測採礦會對它造成什麼影響。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B121","t":"缺乏"},{"w":"decimate","pos":"v.","def":"to destroy or kill a large part of something","cn":"大量毀滅;大幅減少","s":"Disease has ________ the starfish population along the coast, and the number of sea urchins has grown quickly as a result.","zh":"疾病大幅減少了沿岸的海星數量,而海膽的數量因此迅速增加。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B122","t":"大幅減少"},{"w":"demographic","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to the age, size and structure of a population","cn":"人口統計的","s":"________ changes in fishing villages are worrying, because most young people have moved to the cities for work.","zh":"漁村的人口結構變化令人擔憂,因為大部分年輕人都已經搬到城市工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B123","t":"人口結構"},{"w":"diligent","pos":"adj.","def":"working hard and carefully","cn":"勤奮的;用功的","s":"The ________ students recorded the water temperature every day for a year, and their data helped a university project.","zh":"那些勤奮的學生一整年每天記錄水溫,而他們的數據幫助了一項大學研究計畫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B124","t":"勤奮的"},{"w":"discourse","pos":"n.","def":"serious discussion about a subject","cn":"論述;討論","s":"Public ________ about the ocean has changed, because more people now see plastic as a serious problem.","zh":"關於海洋的公眾討論已經改變,因為現在更多人把塑膠視為嚴重的問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B125","t":"討論"},{"w":"disparity","pos":"n.","def":"a large difference between things","cn":"差異;懸殊","s":"There is a large ________ between rich and poor fishermen, because big companies own most of the modern boats.","zh":"富有和貧窮的漁民之間存在很大的差距,因為大公司擁有大部分現代化的船隻。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B126","t":"差距"},{"w":"dispel","pos":"v.","def":"to make a belief or feeling disappear","cn":"消除;驅散","s":"The documentary helped ________ the myth that sharks hunt humans, and many viewers began to support shark protection.","zh":"這部紀錄片幫助破除鯊魚會獵捕人類的迷思,而許多觀眾開始支持保護鯊魚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B127","t":"破除"},{"w":"efficacy","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to produce the result you want","cn":"效力;功效","s":"Scientists are testing the ________ of new nets that let turtles escape, and early results look very promising.","zh":"科學家正在測試能讓海龜逃脫的新漁網的效果,而初步結果看起來很有希望。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B128","t":"效果"},{"w":"emulate","pos":"v.","def":"to try to copy someone because you admire them","cn":"效法;仿效","s":"Other countries hope to ________ Palau's success, because its strict ocean laws have helped fish numbers recover.","zh":"其他國家希望效法帛琉的成功,因為它嚴格的海洋法律幫助魚群數量恢復。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B129","t":"效法"},{"w":"enduring","pos":"adj.","def":"lasting for a long time","cn":"持久的;長久的","s":"The old lighthouse is an ________ symbol of the town, and people still love to take photos there.","zh":"這座老燈塔是小鎮長久的象徵,而人們至今仍喜歡在那裡拍照。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B130","t":"長久的"},{"w":"entrenched","pos":"adj.","def":"firmly established and difficult to change","cn":"根深蒂固的","s":"Eating shark fin soup is an ________ tradition at some weddings, so changing people's habits takes time.","zh":"在某些婚宴上吃魚翅湯是根深蒂固的傳統,所以改變人們的習慣需要時間。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B131","t":"根深蒂固的"},{"w":"ephemeral","pos":"adj.","def":"lasting only a short time","cn":"短暫的","s":"The glowing blue waves are ________, so tourists must visit on the right nights to see them.","zh":"發光的藍色海浪很短暫,所以遊客必須在對的夜晚造訪才能看到。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B132","t":"短暫"},{"w":"eradicate","pos":"v.","def":"to get rid of something completely","cn":"根除;消滅","s":"It is almost impossible to ________ an invasive fish once it spreads, so prevention is the best approach.","zh":"外來魚種一旦擴散就幾乎不可能根除,所以預防是最好的方法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B133","t":"根除"},{"w":"evade","pos":"v.","def":"to escape or avoid something","cn":"躲避;逃避","s":"The illegal fishing boat tried to ________ the coastguard, but it was caught after a two-hour chase.","zh":"那艘非法漁船試圖躲避海巡,但在兩小時的追逐後被逮到。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B134","t":"躲避"},{"w":"exert","pos":"v.","def":"to use power or influence","cn":"施加;運用","s":"Big seafood companies ________ strong influence on fishing laws, so smaller fishermen often feel ignored.","zh":"大型海鮮公司對漁業法規施加強大影響,所以小規模漁民常常覺得被忽略。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B135","t":"施加"},{"w":"extensive","pos":"adj.","def":"covering a large area or including a lot","cn":"廣泛的;大量的","s":"The typhoon caused ________ damage to the harbour, and many boats will need months of repairs.","zh":"颱風對港口造成大範圍的損害,而許多船隻需要好幾個月的修理。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B136","t":"大範圍的"},{"w":"extrapolate","pos":"v.","def":"to use known facts to guess about the future","cn":"推斷;推算","s":"Scientists ________ from current data that the reef could disappear by 2050, although they hope action will change this.","zh":"科學家根據目前的數據推斷珊瑚礁可能在2050年前消失,雖然他們希望採取行動能改變這一點。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B137","t":"推斷"},{"w":"fabricate","pos":"v.","def":"to invent false information to deceive people","cn":"捏造;偽造","s":"The company ________ its fishing records to hide the illegal catch, but inspectors discovered the truth.","zh":"這家公司捏造捕撈紀錄來隱瞞非法漁獲,但檢查人員發現了真相。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B138","t":"捏造"},{"w":"facet","pos":"n.","def":"one part or side of something","cn":"方面;面向","s":"Pollution is only one ________ of the problem, because overfishing and warming are also harming the ocean.","zh":"污染只是問題的一個面向,因為過度捕撈和暖化也在傷害海洋。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B139","t":"面向"},{"w":"fallacy","pos":"n.","def":"a false idea that many people believe","cn":"謬誤;錯誤觀念","s":"It is a ________ that the ocean is too big to be harmed, because human activities have already changed it greatly.","zh":"認為海洋大到不會受到傷害是一種謬誤,因為人類活動已經大大改變了它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B140","t":"謬誤"},{"w":"forge","pos":"v.","def":"to build a strong relationship or agreement","cn":"建立;打造","s":"The two countries hope to ________ a strong partnership to protect the shared sea, and they will meet again next year.","zh":"兩國希望建立強大的夥伴關係來保護共有的海域,而他們明年會再次會面。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B141","t":"建立"},{"w":"formidable","pos":"adj.","def":"very powerful or difficult","cn":"強大的;令人敬畏的","s":"The great white shark is a ________ hunter, but it is now threatened by humans in many parts of the world.","zh":"大白鯊是令人敬畏的獵手,但牠現在在世界許多地方受到人類威脅。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B142","t":"令人敬畏的"},{"w":"frugal","pos":"adj.","def":"careful not to waste money or resources","cn":"節儉的","s":"Island families have long lived ________ lives, so they rarely waste food, water or fuel.","zh":"島上的家庭長久以來過著節儉的生活,所以他們很少浪費食物、水或燃料。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B143","t":"節儉的"},{"w":"fruitful","pos":"adj.","def":"producing good results","cn":"富有成果的","s":"The meeting between fishermen and scientists was ________, because both sides agreed on a new plan for the bay.","zh":"漁民和科學家之間的會議成果豐碩,因為雙方對海灣的新計畫達成共識。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B144","t":"成果豐碩"},{"w":"futile","pos":"adj.","def":"having no chance of success","cn":"徒勞的;無效的","s":"Cleaning the beach may seem ________ when new rubbish arrives every day, but it still saves many animals.","zh":"當每天都有新垃圾漂來時,清理海灘可能看起來是徒勞的,但它仍然拯救了許多動物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B145","t":"徒勞的"},{"w":"hamper","pos":"v.","def":"to make it difficult for something to happen","cn":"妨礙;阻礙","s":"Bad weather ________ the search for the missing fishermen, so the rescue teams had to wait until the wind dropped.","zh":"惡劣天氣阻礙了搜尋失蹤漁民的行動,所以救援隊必須等到風勢減弱。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B146","t":"阻礙"},{"w":"harness","pos":"v.","def":"to control and use natural energy","cn":"利用(自然力)","s":"Engineers are trying to ________ the power of ocean waves, so coastal towns can produce clean electricity.","zh":"工程師正在試著利用海浪的力量,讓沿海城鎮能產生乾淨的電力。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B147","t":"利用"},{"w":"heighten","pos":"v.","def":"to make a feeling or effect stronger","cn":"提高;加強","s":"News about plastic in seafood has ________ public concern, and many shoppers now ask where their fish comes from.","zh":"海鮮中含塑膠的新聞提高了大眾的擔憂,而許多購物者現在會詢問他們的魚來自哪裡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B148","t":"提高"},{"w":"homogeneous","pos":"adj.","def":"made of parts that are all the same","cn":"同質的;均勻的","s":"A fish farm is a ________ environment with only one species, while a wild reef contains hundreds of different ones.","zh":"養魚場是只有一個物種的同質環境,而野生珊瑚礁則有數百種不同的物種。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B149","t":"同質"},{"w":"illuminate","pos":"v.","def":"to make something clearer or easier to understand","cn":"闡明;照亮","s":"The new study helps ________ how whales communicate, because it recorded their songs over many years.","zh":"這項新研究有助於闡明鯨魚如何溝通,因為它記錄了牠們多年來的歌聲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B150","t":"闡明"},{"w":"impending","pos":"adj.","def":"about to happen, usually something bad","cn":"即將發生的","s":"Fishermen rushed back to the harbour because of the ________ storm, and the coastguard closed the sea to all boats.","zh":"漁民們因為即將來臨的暴風雨趕回港口,而海巡對所有船隻封閉了海域。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B151","t":"即將來臨的"},{"w":"impetus","pos":"n.","def":"something that encourages an activity to develop","cn":"動力;推動力","s":"The photos of dying coral gave new ________ to the campaign, and thousands of people joined in the following month.","zh":"垂死珊瑚的照片給了這項運動新的動力,而接下來一個月有數千人加入。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B152","t":"動力"},{"w":"incur","pos":"v.","def":"to experience something unpleasant, such as a cost, as a result of an action","cn":"招致;承擔","s":"Boats that fish in protected areas will ________ heavy fines, and their owners may lose their licences.","zh":"在保護區捕魚的船隻將遭受重罰,而且船主可能失去執照。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B153","t":"遭受"},{"w":"indiscriminate","pos":"adj.","def":"done without careful choice","cn":"不加選擇的;濫用的","s":"________ fishing with huge nets kills dolphins and turtles, so many people now choose seafood with eco-labels.","zh":"用巨網不加選擇地捕魚會殺死海豚和海龜,所以現在許多人選擇有環保標章的海鮮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B154","t":"不加選擇地"},{"w":"influx","pos":"n.","def":"the arrival of many people or things","cn":"湧入","s":"The ________ of tourists every summer brings money to the island, but it also creates huge amounts of rubbish.","zh":"每年夏天遊客的湧入為島嶼帶來收入,但也製造了大量垃圾。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B155","t":"湧入"},{"w":"inhabit","pos":"v.","def":"to live in a place","cn":"居住於;棲息於","s":"Strange creatures ________ the deepest parts of the ocean, and many of them have never been seen by humans.","zh":"奇特的生物棲息在海洋最深的地方,而其中許多從未被人類見過。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B156","t":"棲息"},{"w":"insurmountable","pos":"adj.","def":"too great to be dealt with","cn":"無法克服的","s":"The problem of ocean plastic is not ________, but it needs cooperation between governments, companies and ordinary people.","zh":"海洋塑膠的問題並非無法克服,但它需要政府、企業和一般民眾之間的合作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B157","t":"無法克服"},{"w":"intact","pos":"adj.","def":"complete and not damaged","cn":"完好無缺的","s":"The ship had been underwater for a hundred years, but its wooden hull was still almost ________ because of the cold water.","zh":"這艘船已經在水下一百年了,但因為海水冰冷,它的木製船身仍幾乎完好無缺。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B158","t":"完好無缺"},{"w":"interdependent","pos":"adj.","def":"depending on each other","cn":"相互依賴的","s":"All the creatures on a reef are ________, so the loss of one species can affect many others.","zh":"珊瑚礁上的所有生物都是相互依存的,所以失去一個物種可能會影響許多其他物種。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B159","t":"相互依存的"},{"w":"intrusive","pos":"adj.","def":"disturbing in an unwelcome way","cn":"侵擾的;打擾人的","s":"Some whale-watching boats get too close, which is ________ for the whales, so new rules set a minimum distance.","zh":"有些賞鯨船靠得太近,這對鯨魚來說是一種打擾,所以新規定設定了最小距離。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B160","t":"一種打擾"},{"w":"lucrative","pos":"adj.","def":"producing a lot of money","cn":"有利可圖的;賺錢的","s":"Shark fin is a ________ business for some traders, but it has caused shark numbers to fall all over the world.","zh":"魚翅對某些商人來說是利潤豐厚的生意,但它導致全世界的鯊魚數量下降。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B161","t":"利潤豐厚的"},{"w":"meagre","pos":"adj.","def":"very small in amount","cn":"微薄的;貧乏的","s":"The fishermen's catch was ________ this year, so many families had to find other work to pay their bills.","zh":"今年漁民的漁獲很微薄,所以許多家庭必須找其他工作來支付帳單。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B162","t":"微薄"},{"w":"momentum","pos":"n.","def":"the force that keeps something moving or developing","cn":"動力;氣勢","s":"The campaign against plastic straws gained ________ quickly, and soon many restaurants stopped using them.","zh":"反塑膠吸管運動迅速獲得動力,很快許多餐廳就不再使用吸管。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B163","t":"動力"},{"w":"myriad","pos":"adj.","def":"very many","cn":"無數的;大量的","s":"The reef is home to ________ colourful creatures, and every dive shows you something new and surprising.","zh":"珊瑚礁是無數色彩繽紛生物的家,而每一次潛水都讓你看見新奇又令人驚喜的東西。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B164","t":"無數"},{"w":"obscure","pos":"adj.","def":"not well known","cn":"鮮為人知的","s":"The tiny fish was so ________ that it had no common name, but scientists discovered it could clean sick coral.","zh":"這種小魚非常鮮為人知,連個俗名都沒有,但科學家發現牠能清潔生病的珊瑚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B165","t":"鮮為人知"},{"w":"opt","pos":"v.","def":"to choose one thing instead of another","cn":"選擇","s":"More shoppers now ________ for fish with eco-labels, so supermarkets have started to sell more of them.","zh":"現在更多購物者選擇有環保標章的魚,所以超市已經開始販售更多這類產品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B166","t":"選擇"},{"w":"outweigh","pos":"v.","def":"to be greater or more important than something else","cn":"超過;比……更重要","s":"The long-term benefits of a marine park ________ the short-term losses for fishermen, because fish numbers grow outside the park too.","zh":"海洋公園的長期效益超過漁民的短期損失,因為公園外的魚群數量也會增加。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B167","t":"超過"},{"w":"overlook","pos":"v.","def":"to fail to notice or consider something","cn":"忽視;忽略","s":"People often ________ the role of tiny plankton, but these creatures produce much of the oxygen on Earth.","zh":"人們常常忽略微小浮游生物的角色,但這些生物製造了地球上大部分的氧氣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B168","t":"忽略"},{"w":"perpetuate","pos":"v.","def":"to make something continue, especially something bad","cn":"使持續;使延續","s":"Films that show sharks as monsters ________ people's fear, so fewer people support protecting them.","zh":"把鯊魚描繪成怪物的電影延續了人們的恐懼,所以支持保護牠們的人變少了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B169","t":"延續"},{"w":"pinpoint","pos":"v.","def":"to find or describe something exactly","cn":"精確找出;準確指出","s":"Scientists used satellites to ________ the source of the oil, and they found a ship that had cleaned its tanks at sea.","zh":"科學家利用衛星精確找出油污的來源,並發現了一艘在海上清洗油槽的船。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B170","t":"精確找出"},{"w":"potent","pos":"adj.","def":"very strong or powerful","cn":"強效的;有力的","s":"Some sea snails produce a ________ poison, so divers should never pick up shells that still have animals inside.","zh":"有些海螺會產生強效的毒素,所以潛水員絕不應該撿起裡面還有生物的貝殼。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B171","t":"強效的"},{"w":"precarious","pos":"adj.","def":"not safe or secure; likely to get worse","cn":"不穩定的;岌岌可危的","s":"Many small fishermen are in a ________ situation, because one bad season can leave them without money.","zh":"許多小規模漁民處於岌岌可危的處境,因為一個糟糕的漁季就可能讓他們身無分文。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B172","t":"岌岌可危的"},{"w":"predicament","pos":"n.","def":"a difficult situation","cn":"困境","s":"The village faced a ________, because the new port would bring jobs but would also destroy the beach.","zh":"村莊面臨一個困境,因為新港口會帶來工作,但也會摧毀海灘。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B173","t":"困境"},{"w":"preclude","pos":"v.","def":"to prevent something from happening","cn":"排除;阻止","s":"The strong currents ________ swimming at this beach, so visitors can only walk along the sand.","zh":"強勁的海流使這片海灘無法游泳,所以遊客只能在沙灘上散步。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B174","t":"無法"},{"w":"prerequisite","pos":"n.","def":"something that must exist before something else can happen","cn":"先決條件","s":"Clean water is a ________ for healthy coral, so the town must stop sewage from entering the bay.","zh":"乾淨的水是健康珊瑚的先決條件,所以小鎮必須阻止污水流入海灣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B175","t":"先決條件"},{"w":"pristine","pos":"adj.","def":"completely clean and untouched","cn":"原始的;未受污染的","s":"The island's beaches are still ________, because only a small number of visitors are allowed each day.","zh":"這座島的海灘仍然潔淨原始,因為每天只允許少數遊客進入。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B176","t":"潔淨原始"},{"w":"prolific","pos":"adj.","def":"producing a lot of something","cn":"多產的","s":"Cod are ________ breeders that lay millions of eggs, but overfishing still caused their numbers to crash.","zh":"鱈魚是多產的繁殖者,一次產下數百萬顆卵,但過度捕撈仍然導致牠們的數量崩跌。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B177","t":"多產的"},{"w":"prosper","pos":"v.","def":"to be successful, especially by earning money","cn":"繁榮;興旺","s":"The village began to ________ after the reef recovered, because divers from around the world came to visit.","zh":"珊瑚礁恢復後村莊開始繁榮起來,因為世界各地的潛水客都來造訪。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B178","t":"繁榮"},{"w":"prudent","pos":"adj.","def":"careful and sensible","cn":"謹慎的;明智的","s":"It would be ________ to wait before mining the deep sea, because we still know very little about life there.","zh":"在開採深海之前先等一等是明智的,因為我們對那裡的生物仍所知甚少。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B179","t":"明智的"},{"w":"rampant","pos":"adj.","def":"growing or spreading in an uncontrolled way","cn":"猖獗的;蔓延的","s":"Illegal fishing is ________ in some areas, so honest fishermen find it hard to earn a fair living.","zh":"非法捕魚在某些地區很猖獗,所以誠實的漁民很難賺取合理的生活費。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B180","t":"猖獗"},{"w":"rectify","pos":"v.","def":"to correct something that is wrong","cn":"糾正;矯正","s":"The company promised to ________ the damage it caused, and it paid to replant the mangroves along the river.","zh":"公司承諾彌補它造成的損害,並出資沿著河岸重新種植紅樹林。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B181","t":"彌補"},{"w":"relentless","pos":"adj.","def":"continuing strongly without stopping","cn":"持續不斷的;無情的","s":"The ________ waves slowly wore away the cliff, so the old house on top is now in danger of falling.","zh":"持續不斷的海浪慢慢侵蝕懸崖,所以上面的老房子現在有倒塌的危險。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B182","t":"持續不斷的"},{"w":"remedy","pos":"n.","def":"a way to solve a problem","cn":"補救辦法;解決方法","s":"There is no quick ________ for ocean pollution, but reducing plastic use is an important first step.","zh":"海洋污染沒有快速的解決辦法,但減少塑膠使用是重要的第一步。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B183","t":"解決辦法"},{"w":"resurgence","pos":"n.","def":"a return of something after a period of decline","cn":"復甦;再度興起","s":"There has been a ________ of humpback whales in the area, and whale-watching tours are now fully booked every summer.","zh":"這個地區的座頭鯨數量已經回升,而賞鯨行程現在每年夏天都被訂滿。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B184","t":"回升"},{"w":"revitalise","pos":"v.","def":"to give new life and energy to something","cn":"使恢復活力;振興","s":"The government plans to ________ the old fishing port, so it will attract tourists with cafés and a seafood market.","zh":"政府計畫振興舊漁港,讓它以咖啡館和海鮮市場吸引遊客。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B185","t":"振興"},{"w":"shortfall","pos":"n.","def":"an amount that is less than needed","cn":"短缺;不足","s":"There is a ________ of funding for ocean research, so many important studies have been delayed.","zh":"海洋研究的經費不足,所以許多重要的研究被延後了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B186","t":"不足"},{"w":"skew","pos":"v.","def":"to change information so it is not accurate","cn":"扭曲;使偏離","s":"A few very large catches can ________ the average, so scientists look at many years of data instead.","zh":"幾次非常大量的漁獲可能會扭曲平均值,所以科學家改為觀察多年的數據。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B187","t":"扭曲"},{"w":"steer","pos":"v.","def":"to control the direction of a vehicle or situation","cn":"操縱;引導","s":"The captain had to ________ the boat carefully between the rocks, because the water was very shallow there.","zh":"船長必須小心地在岩石之間駕駛船隻,因為那裡的水非常淺。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B188","t":"駕駛"},{"w":"strive / strove / striven","pos":"v.","def":"to try very hard to achieve something","cn":"努力;奮鬥","s":"The aquarium ________ to teach visitors about ocean protection, and every tour ends with tips for reducing plastic.","zh":"這間水族館努力教導遊客保護海洋的知識,而每次導覽都以減少塑膠的小訣竅作結。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B189","t":"努力"},{"w":"succumb","pos":"v.","def":"to be unable to resist something","cn":"屈服;不敵","s":"Many corals ________ to disease after the heatwave, because they were already weak from the hot water.","zh":"熱浪過後許多珊瑚不敵疾病而死,因為它們已經被高溫海水削弱了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B190","t":"不敵"},{"w":"surpass","pos":"v.","def":"to be better or greater than something","cn":"超越;勝過","s":"Plastic in the ocean may ________ the weight of all fish by 2050, unless we change our habits soon.","zh":"海洋中的塑膠重量可能在2050年超過所有魚類的重量,除非我們儘快改變習慣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B191","t":"超過"},{"w":"vast","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely large","cn":"廣大的;巨大的","s":"The Pacific is so ________ that a ship can sail for weeks without seeing land, and few people have crossed it alone.","zh":"太平洋如此遼闊,一艘船可以航行好幾週都看不到陸地,而很少人曾獨自橫越它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B192","t":"遼闊"},{"w":"vigilant","pos":"adj.","def":"watching carefully for danger","cn":"警惕的;警覺的","s":"Lifeguards must stay ________ all day, because a swimmer can get into trouble in just a few seconds.","zh":"救生員必須整天保持警覺,因為泳客可能在短短幾秒內就陷入危險。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B193","t":"警覺"},{"w":"transient","pos":"adj.","def":"staying only for a short time","cn":"短暫的;過境的","s":"Many of the whales seen near Taiwan are ________ visitors, so they only stay for a few weeks each year.","zh":"在台灣附近看到的許多鯨魚是短暫停留的訪客,所以牠們每年只停留幾週。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B194","t":"短暫停留的"},{"w":"unravel","pos":"v.","def":"to understand or solve something complicated","cn":"解開;闡明","s":"Scientists are trying to ________ the mystery of how eels find their way back to the same sea to lay eggs.","zh":"科學家正在試著解開鰻魚如何找到路回到同一片海域產卵的謎團。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B195","t":"解開"},{"w":"uphold / upheld / upheld","pos":"v.","def":"to support or defend a law or decision","cn":"維護;支持","s":"The court ________ the ban on fishing in the marine park, so the companies that opposed it lost their case.","zh":"法院維持了海洋公園內禁止捕魚的禁令,所以反對的公司輸了官司。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B196","t":"維持"},{"w":"versatile","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be used in many different ways","cn":"多功能的;多才多藝的","s":"Seaweed is a ________ plant, because it can be used in food, medicine and even plastic-free packaging.","zh":"海藻是一種用途多樣的植物,因為它可以用在食物、藥品,甚至無塑包裝上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B197","t":"用途多樣的"},{"w":"turbulent","pos":"adj.","def":"moving in a strong and uneven way","cn":"洶湧的;動盪的","s":"The sea was ________ after the storm, so the ferry to the island was cancelled for two days.","zh":"暴風雨過後海面波濤洶湧,所以前往島上的渡輪停駛了兩天。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B198","t":"波濤洶湧"},{"w":"wane","pos":"v.","def":"to become weaker or smaller","cn":"減弱;衰退","s":"Public interest in the oil spill began to ________ after a few weeks, but the beach was still polluted.","zh":"幾週後大眾對漏油事件的關注開始減弱,但海灘仍然受到污染。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B199","t":"減弱"},{"w":"vigorous","pos":"adj.","def":"strong, active and full of energy","cn":"強健的;有力的","s":"The mangroves showed ________ growth after they were replanted, and birds soon returned to nest in them.","zh":"紅樹林重新種植後展現了旺盛的生長,而鳥類很快就回來在其中築巢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B200","t":"旺盛的"},{"w":"marine protected area","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a part of the sea where human activities are limited to protect nature","cn":"海洋保護區","s":"Fishing is strictly limited inside the ______ ______ ______, so the number of large fish there has doubled in ten years.","zh":"海洋保護區內的捕魚受到嚴格限制,所以那裡的大型魚數量在十年內增加了一倍。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P1","t":"海洋保護區"},{"w":"sustainable fishing","pos":"n.phr.","def":"catching fish in a way that leaves enough to breed","cn":"永續漁業","s":"______ ______ means leaving enough fish in the sea to breed, so future generations can still enjoy seafood.","zh":"永續漁業意味著在海中留下足夠的魚來繁殖,這樣後代子孫仍能享用海鮮。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P2","t":"永續漁業"},{"w":"plastic pollution","pos":"n.phr.","def":"harm to nature caused by plastic waste","cn":"塑膠污染","s":"______ ______ is now found even in the deepest trench, so scientists say no part of the ocean is truly untouched.","zh":"現在即使在最深的海溝也發現了塑膠污染,所以科學家說海洋沒有任何地方是真正未受影響的。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P3","t":"塑膠污染"},{"w":"food web","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the network of who eats whom in an ecosystem","cn":"食物網","s":"If sharks disappear, the whole ______ ______ changes, because the animals they used to eat grow out of control.","zh":"如果鯊魚消失,整個食物網都會改變,因為牠們原本捕食的動物會失控地增加。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P4","t":"食物網"},{"w":"wash up","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to be carried onto the shore by the sea","cn":"被沖上岸","s":"Every morning, plastic bottles ______ ______ on the beach, and volunteers collect them before the tourists arrive.","zh":"每天早上都有塑膠瓶被沖上海灘,志工們會在遊客到達前把它們撿起來。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P5","t":"被沖上"},{"w":"in deep water","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"in serious trouble","cn":"陷入困境;麻煩大了","s":"The fishing company is ______ ______ ______ after it was caught catching sharks illegally, and it may have to close.","zh":"這家漁業公司被抓到非法捕撈鯊魚後陷入大麻煩,而且可能必須關門。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P6","t":"陷入大麻煩"},{"w":"out of one's depth","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"in a situation that is too difficult for your skills","cn":"力不從心;超出能力範圍","s":"I felt completely ______ ______ ______ ______ during the advanced diving course, so I asked the instructor for extra practice.","zh":"在進階潛水課程中我覺得完全力不從心,所以我請教練讓我多練習。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P7","t":"力不從心"},{"w":"make waves","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to cause trouble or attract attention by doing something new","cn":"引起轟動;興風作浪","s":"The young activist began to ______ ______ when her video about ocean plastic went viral, and politicians started to listen.","zh":"當這位年輕行動者關於海洋塑膠的影片爆紅時,她開始引起轟動,而政治人物也開始傾聽。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P8","t":"引起轟動"},{"w":"test the waters","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to try something carefully to see how people react","cn":"試水溫;先試探","s":"The company decided to ______ ______ ______ by selling paper straws in one city, and then it planned to expand.","zh":"這家公司決定先在一個城市販售紙吸管來試水溫,然後計畫再擴大。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P9","t":"試水溫"},{"w":"rock the boat","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to cause problems by challenging the way things are","cn":"搗亂;破壞現狀","s":"Some fishermen did not want to ______ ______ ______ by reporting illegal boats, but one brave captain finally spoke up.","zh":"有些漁民不想透過舉報非法船隻來惹麻煩,但一位勇敢的船長終於站了出來。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P10","t":"惹麻煩"},{"w":"miss the boat","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to lose a chance by being too slow","cn":"錯失良機","s":"Countries that do not invest in clean ocean energy now may ______ ______ ______, while others lead the new industry.","zh":"現在不投資乾淨海洋能源的國家可能會錯失良機,而其他國家則領導這個新產業。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P11","t":"錯失良機"},{"w":"in the same boat","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"in the same difficult situation as others","cn":"處境相同;同舟共濟","s":"All the fishermen in the village are ______ ______ ______ ______, because the typhoon damaged every boat in the harbour.","zh":"村裡所有的漁民都處境相同,因為颱風損壞了港內的每一艘船。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P12","t":"處境相同"},{"w":"sink or swim","pos":"phr.","def":"to succeed or fail without help from others","cn":"自生自滅;成敗靠自己","s":"New guides at the diving centre are not left to ______ ______ ______, because experienced divers train them for a month.","zh":"潛水中心的新導遊不會被放著自生自滅,因為有經驗的潛水員會訓練他們一個月。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P13","t":"自生自滅"},{"w":"a fish out of water","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person who feels uncomfortable in an unfamiliar situation","cn":"如魚離水;不自在的人","s":"I felt like ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ at my first diving club meeting, but the other members were very friendly.","zh":"我在第一次參加潛水社聚會時覺得渾身不自在,但其他社員都非常友善。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P14","t":"渾身不自在"},{"w":"plenty more fish in the sea","pos":"phr.","def":"there are many other people or chances available","cn":"天涯何處無芳草;機會多的是","s":"My friend was sad after her break-up, so I told her there were ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______.","zh":"我朋友分手後很難過,所以我告訴她天涯何處無芳草。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P15","t":"天涯何處無芳草"},{"w":"make a splash","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to attract a lot of attention","cn":"引起轟動","s":"The student's invention for catching microplastics ______ ______ ______ at the science fair, and a company offered to help develop it.","zh":"那位學生捕捉塑膠微粒的發明在科展上引起轟動,而一家公司提議協助開發它。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P16","t":"引起轟動"},{"w":"all at sea","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"confused and not knowing what to do","cn":"茫然不知所措","s":"I was ______ ______ ______ during my first ocean science lecture, but the professor's simple examples helped me understand.","zh":"我在第一堂海洋科學課上感到茫然不知所措,但教授簡單的例子幫助我理解了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P17","t":"茫然不知所措"},{"w":"high and dry","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"left in a difficult situation without help","cn":"孤立無援;陷入困境","s":"When the factory closed, hundreds of workers were left ______ ______ ______, and many moved away from the fishing town.","zh":"工廠關閉時,數百名工人被棄之不顧,而許多人搬離了這個漁港小鎮。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P18","t":"棄之不顧"},{"w":"learn the ropes","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to learn how to do a job or activity","cn":"學會訣竅;熟悉門道","s":"It took me a whole summer to ______ ______ ______ on my uncle's fishing boat, but now I can help him with almost everything.","zh":"我花了一整個夏天才在叔叔的漁船上熟悉門道,但現在幾乎所有事我都能幫他。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P19","t":"熟悉門道"},{"w":"a sea change","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a complete and important change","cn":"徹底的轉變","s":"There has been ______ ______ ______ in how people see sharks, and many now want to protect them instead of fearing them.","zh":"人們看待鯊魚的方式已經有了徹底的轉變,而許多人現在想保護牠們而不是害怕牠們。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P20","t":"徹底的轉變"}]};
